('0f91eac63e3f47e992cb7c28b03e99fd6110e4ea4d3a9e16bd0e1c3d64a61929', 'docs/ACCESSIBILITY.md', 'Accessibility Guidance', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- Unit tests that verify typed props preserve `role`, `aria-*`, `htmlFor`, `autofocus`, and similar markup. - Tests that verify `ui.UseId()` remains stable enough to wire related elements together. - Unit tests that verify `ui.UseCompositeNavigation(...)` and `ui.UseAnnouncer()` preserve their public contracts. - Browser tests for modal focus trap behavior, keyboard composite navigation, validation announcements, and routed page announcements.', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 10236, 10684, '- Unit tests that verify typed props preserve `role`, `aria-*`, `htmlFor`, `autofocus`, and similar markup. - Tests that verify `ui.UseId()` remains stable enough to wire related elements together. - Unit tests that verify `ui.UseCompositeNavigation(...)` and `ui.UseAnnouncer()` preserve their public contracts. - Browser tests for modal focus trap behavior, keyboard composite navigation, validation announcements, and routed page announcements. ', 'Paragraph - Unit tests that verify typed props preserve `role`, `aria-*`, `htmlFor`, `autofocus`, and similar markup.
