- fail CI on deterministic accessibility regressions such as broken focus restore, missing route announcements, or inaccessible query paths
- reserve manual review for screen-reader nuance, visual focus polish, and complex announcement timing that the current automated suite cannot assert reliably yet', 0.9, 'pass', '', 12412, 12787, '- keep at least one browser-runner lane for keyboard and focus behavior - fail CI on deterministic accessibility regressions such as broken focus restore, missing route announcements, or inaccessible query paths - reserve manual review for screen-reader nuance, visual focus polish, and complex announcement timing that the current automated suite cannot assert reliably yet', '- keep at least one browser-runner lane for keyboard and focus behavior - fail CI on deterministic accessibility regressions such as broken focus restore, missing route announcements, or inaccessible query paths - reserve manual review for screen-reader nuance, visual focus polish, and complex announcement timing that the current automated suite cannot assert reliably yet', 0, 0, 'manual-accessibility-20260330T214604Z', 'c241fc8bd79d74dbd9574fe1bf67e7db2340f256763f08452a65f4f4736a7397', '0351f55e11995cac732df4c25a9bd5c70d0a48343b971938b560bcf9c683be2e', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
