('f052d25628169a749d3ce429a4c70d2d248d79d81b59d5948c6de7a2f281a49c', 'docs/ACCESSIBILITY.md', 'Accessibility Guidance', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- `examples/77-accessible-overlay` for modal focus trap, inert background, and dismiss behavior - `examples/78-composite-navigation` for roving tabindex and keyboard movement - `examples/79-form-accessibility` for validation announcements and focus-to-error behavior - `examples/80-routed-accessibility` for route announcements and heading focus after navigation - [examples/MANUAL_TESTING.md](../examples/MANUAL_TESTING.md) for the current manual spot-check list - [TESTING.md](TESTING.md) and [WORKFLOWS.md](WORKFLOWS.md#test-a-component-or-app-flow) for the current automated validation lanes', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 13010, 13606, '- `examples/77-accessible-overlay` for modal focus trap, inert background, and dismiss behavior - `examples/78-composite-navigation` for roving tabindex and keyboard movement - `examples/79-form-accessibility` for validation announcements and focus-to-error behavior - `examples/80-routed-accessibility` for route announcements and heading focus after navigation - [examples/MANUAL_TESTING.md](../examples/MANUAL_TESTING.md) for the current manual spot-check list - [TESTING.md](TESTING.md) and [WORKFLOWS.md](WORKFLOWS.md#test-a-component-or-app-flow) for the current automated validation lanes ', 'Paragraph - `examples/77-accessible-overlay` for modal focus trap, inert background, and dismiss behavior
- `examples/78-composite-navigation` for roving tabindex and keyboard movement
- `examples/79-form-accessibility` for validation announcements and focus-to-error behavior
