('2a332b92b62df9e2cd22a43434c847173421bf9a', 'docs/ADOPTION_MATURITY.md', 'Adoption Maturity, Starters, and Enterprise Evaluation', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- production readiness is feature-area specific, not one global label - the primary reference application is `examples/86-atlas-commerce-os` - starters are tracked by support tier and verification cadence - ecosystem entries are tracked with ownership and maintenance signals - enterprise evaluation uses one concise packet and explicit risk labels - learning and community paths extend beyond core runtime code contribution', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 342, 766, '- production readiness is feature-area specific, not one global label - the primary reference application is `examples/86-atlas-commerce-os` - starters are tracked by support tier and verification cadence - ecosystem entries are tracked with ownership and maintenance signals - enterprise evaluation uses one concise packet and explicit risk labels - learning and community paths extend beyond core runtime code contribution', '- production readiness is feature-area specific, not one global label - the primary reference application is `examples/86-atlas-commerce-os` - starters are tracked by support tier and verification cadence - ecosystem entries are tracked with ownership and maintenance signals - enterprise evaluation uses one concise packet and explicit risk labels - learning and community paths extend beyond core runtime code contribution', 0.9, 'pass', '', 342, 766, '- production readiness is feature-area specific, not one global label - the primary reference application is `examples/86-atlas-commerce-os` - starters are tracked by support tier and verification cadence - ecosystem entries are tracked with ownership and maintenance signals - enterprise evaluation uses one concise packet and explicit risk labels - learning and community paths extend beyond core runtime code contribution', '- production readiness is feature-area specific, not one globa