 an LTS or older-major backport line today.', 0.9, 'pass', '', 16170, 16270, 'The project is therefore explicitly choosing not to offer an LTS or older-major backport line today.', 'The project is therefore explicitly choosing not to offer an LTS or older-major backport line today.', 0, 0, 'manual-api_policy-20260330T214721488Z', 'd625ac35ef34e5cd12110c18958ef6a91b366bd9876afaef1e3432fd0eb56349', '186417387be46f923762440be0604de83077a2c566ac7fda7368a7d7cf0aa9e6', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
