 Go or writing the equivalent Go by hand', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 4790, 5026, '- the authored input is optional - the emitted output is readable Go - the generated component still follows the normal runtime ownership model - disabling the experiment means using the generated Go or writing the equivalent Go by hand', '- the authored input is optional - the emitted output is readable Go - the generated component still follows the normal runtime ownership model - disabling the experiment means using the generated Go or writing the equivalent Go by hand', 0.9, 'pass', '', 4790, 5026, '- the authored input is optional - the emitted output is readable Go - the generated component still follows the normal runtime ownership model - disabling the experiment means using the generated Go or writing the equivalent Go by hand', '- the authored input is optional - the emitted output is readable Go - the generated component still follows the normal runtime ownership model - disabling the experiment means using the generated Go or writing the equivalent Go by hand', 0, 0, 'manual-compiler_assisted_features-20260330T214721641Z', '7484edc0a29fb3d94a1207c6d4b5cdb5c1349c6f43642f6866e9625ef082e46c', '925a2a77135b1741df407c82be011823317a1091e0821eaf6f45d1c5215f6b9f', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
