('1ec852cdc723587bb71f9cbb1188160c0f1eee44', 'docs/CROSS_TAB.md', 'Cross-Tab Synchronization', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- use one channel per logical concern such as `theme`, `auth`, `draft:checkout`, or `cache:workspace` - do not publish unrelated concerns into one global channel unless the payloads truly share lifecycle and merge rules - use a custom `StorageKey` only when multiple apps or environments might otherwise collide in shared browser storage - prefer small invalidation or intent messages over full app-state replication', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 3513, 3929, '- use one channel per logical concern such as `theme`, `auth`, `draft:checkout`, or `cache:workspace` - do not publish unrelated concerns into one global channel unless the payloads truly share lifecycle and merge rules - use a custom `StorageKey` only when multiple apps or environments might otherwise collide in shared browser storage - prefer small invalidation or intent messages over full app-state replication', '- use one channel per logical concern such as `theme`, `auth`, `draft:checkout`, or `cache:workspace` - do not publish unrelated concerns into one global channel unless the payloads truly share lifecycle and merge rules - use a custom `StorageKey` only when multiple apps or environments might otherwise collide in shared browser storage - prefer small invalidation or intent messages over full app-state replication', 0.9, 'pass', '', 3513, 3929, '- use one channel per logical concern such as `theme`, `auth`, `draft:checkout`, or `cache:workspace` - do not publish unrelated concerns into one global channel unless the payloads truly share lifecycle and merge rules - use a custom `StorageKey` only when multiple apps or environments might otherwise collide in shared browser storage - prefer small invalidation or intent messages over full app-state replication', '- use one channel per logical concern such as `theme`, `auth`, `draft:checkout`, or `cache:workspace` - do not publish unrelate