('15a41dc4ca42ed2b79a343340f3adb562ce2e2ef', 'docs/DATA_LOADING_AND_MUTATION_ARCHITECTURE.md', 'Data Loading And Mutation Architecture', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', 'Use the smallest data-loading or mutation tool that matches the screen:', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 546, 617, 'Use the smallest data-loading or mutation tool that matches the screen:', 'Use the smallest data-loading or mutation tool that matches the screen:', 0.9, 'pass', '', 546, 617, 'Use the smallest data-loading or mutation tool that matches the screen:', 'Use the smallest data-loading or mutation tool that matches the screen:', 0, 0, 'manual-data_loading_and_mutation_architecture-20260330T214721683Z', '65083a0143ebcc7ff2ee0117d9fc1b03486f34fdf779e7d8256d1c5ce1331a3c', 'ee6fe7f9ff699361dd8367aebfdadd7186f80daa76c38f97fca3bcda97247634', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
('3594fb9314cc27b150d9d373af0df57a0f5b9da6', 'docs/DATA_LOADING_AND_MUTATION_ARCHITECTURE.md', 'Data Loading And Mutation Architecture', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- `fetch.UseFetch(...)`: raw browser-style fetch state when you want the response shape directly - `fetch.UseResource[T](...)`: typed component-owned async data - route loaders: route-owned first-load data, params-aware reads, and SSR-aware route entry data - `fetch.UseCachedResource[T](...)`: shared async data that several consumers or routes reuse - `fetch.LoadCached[T](...)`: non-hook cache reuse from route loaders or imperative code - `ui.UseForm[T]` plus explicit submit handlers: authoritative mutation path for most forms - optimistic `CachedResource.Set(...)` or `Update(...)`: local UX improvement around a real mutation - `fetch.OpenMutationQueue(...)`: durable offline replay for writes that must survive reloads', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 619, 1346, '- `fetch.UseFetch(...)`: raw browser-style fetch state when you want the response shape directly - `fetch.UseResource[T](...)`: typed component-owned async data - route loaders: route-owned first-load data, params-aware reads, and SSR-aware route entry data - `fetch.UseCachedResource[T](...)`: shared async data that several consumers or routes reuse - `fetch.LoadCached[T](...)`: non-hook cache reuse from route loaders or imperative code - `ui.UseForm[T]` plus explicit submit handlers: authoritative mutation path for most forms - optimistic `CachedResource.Set(...)` or `Update(...)`: local UX improvement around a real mutation - `fetch.OpenMutationQueue(...)`: durable offline replay for writes that must survive reloads', '- `fetch.UseFetch(...)`: raw browser-style fetch state when you want the response shape directly - `fetch.UseResource[T](...)`: typed component-owned async data - route loaders: route-owned first-load data, params-aware reads, and SSR-aware route entry data - `fetch.UseCachedResource[T](...)`: shared async data that several consumers or routes reuse - `fetch.LoadCached[T](...)`: non-hook cache reuse from route loaders or imperative code - `ui.UseForm[T]` plus explicit submit handlers: authoritative mutation path for most forms - optimistic `CachedResource.Set(...)` or `Update(...)`: local UX improvement around a real mutation - `fetch.OpenMutationQueue(...)`: durable offline replay for writes that must survive reloads', 0.9, 'pass', '', 619, 1346, '- `fetch.UseFetch(...)`: raw browser-style fetch state when you want the response shape directly - `fetch.UseResource[T](...)`: typed component-owned async data - route loaders: route-owned first-load data, params-aware reads, and SSR-aware route entry data - `fetch.UseCachedResource[T](...)`: shared async data that several consumers or routes reuse - `fetch.LoadCached[T](...)`: non-hook cache reuse from route loaders or imperative code - `ui.UseForm[T]` plus explicit submit handlers: authoritative mutation path for most forms - optimistic `CachedResource.Set(...)` or `Update(...)`: local UX improvement around a real mutation - `fetch.OpenMutationQueue(...)`: durable offline replay for writes that must survive reloads', '- `fetch.UseFetch(...)`: raw browser-style fetch state when you want the response shape directly - `fetch.UseResource[T](...)`: typed component-owned async data - route loaders: route-owned first-load data, params-aware reads, and SSR-aware route entry data - `fetch.UseCachedResource[T](...)`: shared async data that several consumers or routes reuse - `fetch.LoadCached[T](...)`: non-hook cache reuse from route loaders or imperative code - `ui.UseForm[T]` plus explicit submit handlers: authoritative mutation path for most forms - optimistic `CachedResource.Set(...)` or `Update(...)`: local UX improvement around a real mutation - `fetch.OpenMutationQueue(...)`: durable offline replay for writes that must survive reloads', 0, 0, 'manual-data_loading_and_mutation_architecture-20260330T214721683Z', '65083a0143ebcc7ff2ee0117d9fc1b03486f3