('19414ccf5451ffc1c5e2b0a6087831d17bf3b42f', 'docs/DOC_INGESTION_PLAN.md', 'DOC INGESTION PLAN', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', 'Before confidence-based tie-breaks, treat rows with the same doc_path and the same source span as a dedicated collision class. Only collapse them if they are materially the same row after considering: - concept_type - concept_title - normalized concept_text - normalized concept_json This avoids dropping distinct but adjacent or normalization-shifted rows too aggressively.', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 9657, 10031, 'Before confidence-based tie-breaks, treat rows with the same doc_path and the same source span as a dedicated collision class. Only collapse them if they are materially the same row after considering: - concept_type - concept_title - normalized concept_text - normalized concept_json This avoids dropping distinct but adjacent or normalization-shifted rows too aggressively.', 'Before confidence-based tie-breaks, treat rows with the same doc_path and the same source span as a dedicated collision class. Only collapse them if they are materially the same row after considering: - concept_type - concept_title - normalized concept_text - normalized concept_json This avoids dropping distinct but adjacent or normalization-shifted rows too aggressively.', 0.9, 'pass', '', 9657, 10031, 'Before confidence-based tie-breaks, treat rows with the same doc_path and the same source span as a dedicated collision class. Only collapse them if they are materially the same row after considering: - concept_type - concept_title - normalized concept_text - normalized concept_json This avoids dropping distinct but adjacent or normalization-shifted rows too aggressively.', 'Before confidence-based tie-breaks, treat rows with the same doc_path and the same source span as a dedicated collision class. Only collapse them if they are materially the same row after considering: - concept_type - concept_title - normalized concept_text - normalized concept_json This av