('f6ee5274a0ffca9c5e75eb6757eca1458016e1fa', 'docs/FINE_GRAINED_REACTIVITY.md', 'Fine-Grained Reactivity\n\nLast updated: 2026-03-20\n\nThis document defines the first shipped boundary for fine-grained reactivity in GoWebComponents.\n\nThe goal is narrower updates for high-frequency UI paths so atom or signal-style changes do not always force full component or page-level rerenders.\n\n## At A Glance', NULL, 'heading', 'heading', 'Fine-Grained Reactivity\n\nLast updated: 2026-03-20\n\nThis document defines the first shipped boundary for fine-grained reactivity in GoWebComponents.\n\nThe goal is narrower updates for high-frequency UI paths so atom or signal-style changes do not always force full component or page-level rerenders.\n\n## At A Glance', '{"type":"heading","level":1}', 0, 323, '# Fine-Grained Reactivity\n\nLast updated: 2026-03-20\n\nThis document defines the first shipped boundary for fine-grained reactivity in GoWebComponents.\n\nThe goal is narrower updates for high-frequency UI paths so atom or signal-style changes do not always force full component or page-level rerenders.\n\n## At A Glance', 'heading Fine-Grained Reactivity\n\nLast updated: 2026-03-20\n\nThis document defines the first shipped boundary for fine-grained reactivity in GoWebComponents.\n\nThe goal is narrower updates for high-frequency UI paths so atom or signal-style changes do not always force full component or page-level rerenders.\n\n## At A Glance', 0.95, 'pass', '', 0, 323, '# Fine-Grained Reactivity\n\nLast updated: 2026-03-20\n\nThis document defines the first shipped boundary for fine-grained reactivity in GoWebComponents.\n\nThe goal is narrower updates for high-frequency UI paths so atom or signal-style changes do not always force full component or page-level rerenders.\n\n## At A Glance', 'Fine-Grained Reactivity\n\nLast updated: 2026-03-20\n\nThis document defines the first shipped boundary for fine-grained reactivity in GoWebComponents.\n\nThe goal is narrower updates for high-frequency UI paths so atom or signal-style changes do not always force full component or page-level rerenders.\n\n## At A Glance', 0, 0, 'manual-fine_grained_reactivity-20260330T214721767Z', '095f56dc0f9a1e54dac6cdf757782965721588f92932376bfdfd603fb8721376', '87bfd28b1afc7a8864250bd2818d07aa081c8caba8dfa767763bef3e502b9bdd', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
