('74e12cd7c1905d20a8211ce3eb6ac03d4e6b04bd', 'docs/FRAMEWORK_SCOPE.md', 'Framework Scope', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', 'GoWebComponents remains a UI framework, not a first-party app framework.', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 19, 91, 'GoWebComponents remains a UI framework, not a first-party app framework.', 'GoWebComponents remains a UI framework, not a first-party app framework.', 0.9, 'pass', '', 19, 91, 'GoWebComponents remains a UI framework, not a first-party app framework.', 'GoWebComponents remains a UI framework, not a first-party app framework.', 0, 0, 'manual-framework_scope-20260330T214721791Z', 'b444d27ef5ea88366d58bc857b866cda59d2960a2cbe73e25fd4faf81df927ef', '010c8ad0acce2d718ba1692eb5e583bed44d35177a1c622bca0775ae72de8947', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
('42211572dff3bce140dd323ef37c55575c6ddf8f', 'docs/FRAMEWORK_SCOPE.md', 'Framework Scope', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- Core owns reusable UI/runtime primitives: rendering, hooks, state, fetch, router primitives, SSR or hydration, devtools, and diagnostics. - Core does not aim to become a convention-heavy application platform with file-based routing, deployment adapters, or starter-owned build rules. - Opinionated app shells should live in starters, sibling packages, or documented workflows rather than expanding the core runtime API by default. - Fine-grained reactivity is in scope as a performance direction when it improves narrow hot-path updates without replacing the existing component model. - Server-owned interactive rendering is not part of the current core product direction.', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 109, 783, '- Core owns reusable UI/runtime primitives: rendering, hooks, state, fetch, router primitives, SSR or hydration, devtools, and diagnostics. - Core does not aim to become a convention-heavy application platform with file-based routing, deployment adapters, or starter-owned build rules. - Opinionated app shells should live in starters, sibling packages, or documented workflows rather than expanding the core runtime API by default. - Fine-grained reactivity is in scope as a performance direction when it improves narrow hot-path updates without replacing the existing component model. - Server-owned interactive rendering is not part of the current core product direction.', '- Core owns reusable UI/runtime primitives: rendering, hooks, state, fetch, router primitives, SSR or hydration, devtools, and diagnostics. - Core does not aim to become a convention-heavy application platform with file-based routing, deployment adapters, or starter-owned build rules. - Opinionated app shells should live in starters, sibling packages, or documented workflows rather than expanding the core runtime API by default. - Fine-grained reactivity is in scope as a performance direction when it improves narrow hot-path updates without replacing the existing component model. - Server-owned interactive rendering is not part of the current core product direction.', 0.9, 'pass', '', 109, 783, '- Core owns reusable UI/runtime primitives: rendering, hooks, state, fetch, router primitives, SSR or hydration, devtools, and diagnostics. - Core does not aim to become a convention-heavy application platform with file-based routing, deployment adapters, or starter-owned build rules. - Opinionated app shells should live in starters, sibling packages, or documented workflows rather than expanding the core runtime API by default. - Fine-grained reactivity is in scope as a performance direction when it improves narrow hot-path updates without replacing the existing component model. - Server-owned interactive rendering is not part of the current core product direction.', '- Core owns reusable UI/runtime primitives: rendering, hooks, state, fetch, router primitives, SSR or hydration, devtools, and diagnostics. - Core does not aim to become a convention-heavy application platform with file-based routing, deployment adapters, or starter-owned build rules. - Opinionated app shells should live in starters, sibling packages, or documented workflows rather than expanding the core runtime API by default. - Fine-grained reactivity is in scope as a performance direction when it improves narrow hot-path updates without replacing the existing component model. - Server-owned interactive rendering is not part of the current core product direction.', 0, 0, 'manual-framework_scope-20260330T214721791Z', 'b444d27ef5ea88366d58bc857b866cda59d2960a2cbe73e25fd4faf81df927ef', '69eeae12aaf97325930ecc4e802349ece665d88cd58e95a3223daa0c5ffca3c8', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
('d22f47ccb19fef5d52c73f3801973d660e3dc3b3', 'docs/FRAMEWORK_SCOPE.md', 'Framework Scope', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', 'Keep a capability in core when:', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 806, 837, 'Keep a capability in core when:', 'Keep a capability in core when:', 0.9, 'pass', '', 806, 837, 'Keep a capability in core when:', 'Keep a capability in core when:', 0, 0, 'manual-framework_scope-20260330T214721791Z', 'b444d27ef5ea88366d58bc857b866cda59d2960a2cbe73e25fd4faf81df927ef', '64012d27383be41c5c6e12d14f748b6e76a0d51de86e6ca3385691bade722c31', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
('0a5026cfc7b3bbdae32add64e394e34049b34272', 'docs/FRAMEWORK_SCOPE.md', 'Framework Scope', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- it is a reusable runtime or UI primitive needed across many app shapes - it improves correctness, debuggability, or performance without imposing one app structure - it fits the existing browser-owned runtime model and public package surface', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 839, 1081, '- it is a reusable runtime or UI primitive needed across many app shapes - it improves correctness, debuggability, or performance without imposing one app structure - it fits the existing browser-owned runtime model and public package surface', '- it is a reusable runtime or UI primitive needed across many app shapes - it improves correctness, debuggability, or performance without imposing one app structure - it fits the existing browser-owned runtime model and public package surface', 0.9, 'pass', '', 839, 1081, '- it is a reusable runtime or UI primitive needed across many app shapes - it improves correctness, debuggability, or performance without imposing one app structure - it fits the existing browser-owned runtime model and public package surface', '- it is a reusable runtime or UI primitive needed across many app shapes - it improves correctness, debuggability, or performance without imposing one app structure - it fits the existing browser-owned runtime model and public package surface', 0, 0, 'manual-framework_scope-20260330T214721791Z', 'b444d27ef5ea88366d58bc857b866cda59d2960a2cbe73e25fd4faf81df927ef', '6c81129e5bb425121b74637db5c5b5f7598fd4f3ff7f28e71038c0d5cd9d63c5', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
