('451b47f3795ad7cbf5a9e5f60c0b6618b8bf9ea0', 'docs/FRAMEWORK_SCOPE.md', 'Framework Scope', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- file-based routing conventions - deployment adapters for specific hosts or platforms - opinionated starter scaffolds and generated project layouts - convention-heavy build pipelines that assume one app shape - server-owned interactive rendering as a normal framework mode', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 4643, 4916, '- file-based routing conventions - deployment adapters for specific hosts or platforms - opinionated starter scaffolds and generated project layouts - convention-heavy build pipelines that assume one app shape - server-owned interactive rendering as a normal framework mode', '- file-based routing conventions - deployment adapters for specific hosts or platforms - opinionated starter scaffolds and generated project layouts - convention-heavy build pipelines that assume one app shape - server-owned interactive rendering as a normal framework mode', 0.9, 'pass', '', 4643, 4916, '- file-based routing conventions - deployment adapters for specific hosts or platforms - opinionated starter scaffolds and generated project layouts - convention-heavy build pipelines that assume one app shape - server-owned interactive rendering as a normal framework mode', '- file-based routing conventions - deployment adapters for specific hosts or platforms - opinionated starter scaffolds and generated project layouts - convention-heavy build pipelines that assume one app shape - server-owned interactive rendering as a normal framework mode', 0, 0, 'manual-framework_scope-20260330T214721791Z', 'b444d27ef5ea88366d58bc857b866cda59d2960a2cbe73e25fd4faf81df927ef', '8e52281bbb7b2aeefeef202b98d9130124e263f31583fb78094d41f6267ee047', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
('00fadc4a152ba0b63933ef46f89dd7a099f3fcdd', 'docs/FRAMEWORK_SCOPE.md', 'Framework Scope', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- Keep the core API focused on reusable UI/runtime primitives. - Add production-app guidance in the onboarding and server-integration docs instead of moving those conventions into the runtime. - Prefer starter variants when a project wants a more opinionated app shell. - Introduce fine-grained primitives only behind explicit APIs, benchmarks, and diagnostics so the narrower update model stays debuggable.', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 4937, 5344, '- Keep the core API focused on reusable UI/runtime primitives. - Add production-app guidance in the onboarding and server-integration docs instead of moving those conventions into the runtime. - Prefer starter variants when a project wants a more opinionated app shell. - Introduce fine-grained primitives only behind explicit APIs, benchmarks, and diagnostics so the narrower update model stays debuggable.', '- Keep the core API focused on reusable UI/runtime primitives. - Add production-app guidance in the onboarding and server-integration docs instead of moving those conventions into the runtime. - Prefer starter variants when a project wants a more opinionated app shell. - Introduce fine-grained primitives only behind explicit APIs, benchmarks, and diagnostics so the narrower update model stays debuggable.', 0.9, 'pass', '', 4937, 5344, '- Keep the core API focused on reusable UI/runtime primitives. - Add production-app guidance in the onboarding and server-integration docs instead of moving those conventions into the runtime. - Prefer starter variants when a project wants a more opinionated app shell. - Introduce fine-grained primitives only behind explicit APIs, benchmarks, and diagnostics so the narrower update model stays debuggable.', '- Keep the core API focused on reusable UI/runtime primitives. - Add production-app guidance in the onboarding and server-integration docs instead of moving those conventions into the runtime. - Prefer starter variants when a project wants a more opinionated app shell. - Introduce fine-grained primitives only behind explicit APIs, benchmarks, and diagnostics so the narrower update model stays debuggable.', 0, 0, 'manual-framework_scope-20260330T214721791Z', 'b444d27ef5ea88366d58bc857b866cda59d2960a2cbe73e25fd4faf81df927ef', '60a3548e1f54128c5ab521f205284e19918c45b184e9b80b2ac58e9356e0b838', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
