('2fba43c7d8731a2a5c5b6e53e6ff0a1e644fcc10', 'docs/HOT_RELOAD.md', 'Hot Reload', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', 'The current rule is:', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 16136, 16156, 'The current rule is:', 'The current rule is:', 0.9, 'pass', '', 16136, 16156, 'The current rule is:', 'The current rule is:', 0, 0, 'manual-hot_reload-20260330T214721812Z', '77639bd1a56c2c1a0e718e3dd8cccb376209acbe77e80b558c429b4055dd15f4', '2f3b56b018cf8d2639ba5b13ce371d6a0dec16c234d7a5be4d28982300a8769d', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
('0ec1a9002657669dbe74b68cec7a9d1254615c72', 'docs/HOT_RELOAD.md', 'Hot Reload', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- atom snapshots and signature-compatible component-local hook values may restore - pending async work from the old module instance is not treated as resumable unless a hook explicitly restores a safe serializable view of it - router registrations, navigation listeners, route factory closures, guards, loaders, and metadata ownership should be rebuilt from the new bundle instead of preserved from the old one', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 16158, 16568, '- atom snapshots and signature-compatible component-local hook values may restore - pending async work from the old module instance is not treated as resumable unless a hook explicitly restores a safe serializable view of it - router registrations, navigation listeners, route factory closures, guards, loaders, and metadata ownership should be rebuilt from the new bundle instead of preserved from the old one', '- atom snapshots and signature-compatible component-local hook values may restore - pending async work from the old module instance is not treated as resumable unless a hook explicitly restores a safe serializable view of it - router registrations, navigation listeners, route factory closures, guards, loaders, and metadata ownership should be rebuilt from the new bundle instead of preserved from the old one', 0.9, 'pass', '', 16158, 16568, '- atom snapshots and signature-compatible component-local hook values may restore - pending async work from the old module instance is not treated as resumable unless a hook explicitly restores a safe serializable view of it - router registrations, navigation listeners, route factory closures, guards, loaders, and metadata ownership should be rebuilt from the new bundle instead of preserved from the old one', '- atom snapshots and signature-compatible component-local hook values may restore - pending async work from the old module instance is not treated as resumable u