('19785173f78cfe181d2a2c0b57df90bd7ae51aaf', 'docs/HYDRATION.md', 'Hydration', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- valid matching markup should reuse DOM and hydrate normally - text and attribute mismatches degrade to warnings plus client-owned final DOM updates - structural mismatches degrade to subtree replacement, not whole-app restart by default - hydration mismatch recovery is not rendered through `ui.ErrorBoundary` fallback UI - strict hydration is opt-in for development and test workflows, not the default production mode', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 8408, 8828, '- valid matching markup should reuse DOM and hydrate normally - text and attribute mismatches degrade to warnings plus client-owned final DOM updates - structural mismatches degrade to subtree replacement, not whole-app restart by default - hydration mismatch recovery is not rendered through `ui.ErrorBoundary` fallback UI - strict hydration is opt-in for development and test workflows, not the default production mode', '- valid matching markup should reuse DOM and hydrate normally - text and attribute mismatches degrade to warnings plus client-owned final DOM updates - structural mismatches degrade to subtree replacement, not whole-app restart by default - hydration mismatch recovery is not rendered through `ui.ErrorBoundary` fallback UI - strict hydration is opt-in for development and test workflows, not the default production mode', 0.9, 'pass', '', 8408, 8828, '- valid matching markup should reuse DOM and hydrate normally - text and attribute mismatches degrade to warnings plus client-owned final DOM updates - structural mismatches degrade to subtree replacement, not whole-app restart by default - hydration mismatch recovery is not rendered through `ui.ErrorBoundary` fallback UI - strict hydration is opt-in for development and test workflows, not the default production mode', '- valid matching markup should reuse DOM and hydrate normally - text and attribute mismatches degrade to warnings plus client-o