('ad3fa2c6a0455e7cf8aaf79e1e85827de1fb4e9f', 'docs/MULTI_SURFACE.md', 'Multi-Surface Coordination', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', 'This page documents the current first-class model for coordinating multiple active browser surfaces in GoWebComponents.', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 30, 149, 'This page documents the current first-class model for coordinating multiple active browser surfaces in GoWebComponents.', 'This page documents the current first-class model for coordinating multiple active browser surfaces in GoWebComponents.', 0.9, 'pass', '', 30, 149, 'This page documents the current first-class model for coordinating multiple active browser surfaces in GoWebComponents.', 'This page documents the current first-class model for coordinating multiple active browser surfaces in GoWebComponents.', 0, 0, 'manual-multi_surface-20260330T214721896Z', '95c999b0f3f975d8728c5aa90bf4dec0741b574b22f95c63a0d3f604cdedab71', 'acecc0c87184a1ae3c32db6ac8ccafe973a79443a47b8ea422ae622709a75b23', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
('b8c4f3521cbd9521f761770b62845f0b9edccfee', 'docs/MULTI_SURFACE.md', 'Multi-Surface Coordination', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', 'Use it when an application needs a popup or secondary window to cooperate with the main app without hand-rolling `window.open` and `postMessage` plumbing.', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 151, 305, 'Use it when an application needs a popup or secondary window to cooperate with the main app without hand-rolling `window.open` and `postMessage` plumbing.', 'Use it when an application needs a popup or secondary window to cooperate with the main app without hand-rolling `window.open` and `postMessage` plumbing.', 0.9, 'pass', '', 151, 305, 'Use it when an application needs a popup or secondary window to cooperate with the main app without hand-rolling `window.open` and `postMessage` plumbing.', 'Use it when an application needs a popup or secondary window to cooperate with the main app without hand-rolling `window.open` and `postMessage` plumbing.', 0, 0, 'manual-multi_surface-20260330T214721896Z', '95c999b0f3f975d8728c5aa90bf4dec0741b574b22f95c63a0d3f604cdedab71', '331a789ee52ec59bc45f905d6ca7d1c29ede1071b554b10131ff0ba3dd2221c3', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
('3e9121c6e499ce9ae0ff4f8a869c5a38378b4a6c', 'docs/MULTI_SURFACE.md', 'Multi-Surface Coordination', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- the current surface is a typed same-origin window-messaging layer over `postMessage` - it is designed for opener and popup workflows, not general browser-wide peer discovery - the main helpers are `OpenSecondaryWindowChannel(...)`, `WindowOpenerChannel(...)`, typed window-envelope decoding, and `SurfaceSignal` convenience helpers - ownership stays explicit: one surface owns lifecycle and canonical writes, the other acts as a specialized collaborator', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 323, 778, '- the current surface is a typed same-origin window-messaging layer over `postMessage` - it is designed for opener and popup workflows, not general browser-wide peer discovery - the main helpers are `OpenSecondaryWindowChannel(...)`, `WindowOpenerChannel(...)`, typed window-envelope decoding, and `SurfaceSignal` convenience helpers - ownership stays explicit: one surface owns lifecycle and canonical writes, the other acts as a specialized collaborator', '- the current surface is a typed same-origin window-messaging layer over `postMessage` - it is designed for opener and popup workflows, not general browser-wide peer discovery - the main helpers are `OpenSecondaryWindowChannel(...)`, `WindowOpenerChannel(...)`, typed window-envelope decoding, and `SurfaceSignal` convenience helpers - ownership stays explicit: one surface owns lifecycle and canonical writes, the other acts as a specialized collaborator', 0.9, 'pass', '', 323, 778, '- the current surface is a typed same-origin window-messaging layer over `postMessage` - it is designed for opener and popup workflows, not general browser-wide peer discovery - the main helpers are `OpenSecondaryWindowChannel(...)`, `WindowOpenerChannel(...)`, typed window-envelope decoding, and `SurfaceSignal` convenience helpers - ownership stays explicit: one surface owns lifecycle and canonical writes, the other acts as a specialized collaborator', '- the current surface is a typed same-origin window-messaging layer over `postMessage` - it is designed for opener and popup workflows, not general browser-wide peer discovery - the main helpers are `OpenSecondaryWindowChannel(...)`, `WindowOpenerChannel(...)`, typed window-envelope decoding, and `SurfaceSignal` convenience helpers - ownership stays explicit: one surface owns lifecycle and canonical writes, the other acts as a specialized collaborator', 0, 0, 'manual-multi_surface-20260330T214721896Z', '95c999b0f3f975d8728c5aa90bf4dec0741b574b22f95c63a0d3f604cdedab71', 'af914b297503909b74af59b5b00533e01d7c78018fa0b5d8fc4c1ca85e0c20d2', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
('959682a23712312cb7d0c252c168b2215af70514', 'docs/MULTI_SURFACE.md', 'Multi-Surface Coordination', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- use `interop.OpenSecondaryWindowChannel(...)` in the opener when the current app launches and owns the popup lifecycle - use `interop.WindowOpenerChannel(...)` inside the popup when it needs to talk back to its opener - use `interop.SubscribeDecodedWindow[T](...)` when the workflow has its own typed payloads - use `interop.SubscribeSurfaceSignals(...)` plus `PublishSessionExpired(...)`, `PublishRouteFocus(...)`, `PublishSelection(...)`, or `PublishIntent(...)` when the payload is one of the common session or surface-coordination cases - use cross-tab channels instead of window channels when there is no direct opener or popup relationship', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 802, 1449, '- use `interop.OpenSecondaryWindowChannel(...)` in the opener when the current app launches and owns the popup lifecycle - use `interop.WindowOpenerChannel(...)` inside the popup when it needs to talk back to its opener - use `interop.SubscribeDecodedWindow[T](...)` when the workflow has its own typed payloads - use `interop.SubscribeSurfaceSignals(...)` plus `PublishSessionExpired(...)`, `PublishRouteFocus(...)`, `PublishSelection(...)`, or `PublishIntent(...)` when the payload is one of the common session or surface-coordination cases - use cross-tab channels instead of window channels when there is no direct opener or popup relationship', '- use `interop.OpenSecondaryWindowChannel(...)` in the opener when the current app launches and owns the popup lifecycle - use `interop.WindowOpenerChannel(...)` inside the popup when it needs to talk back to its opener - use `interop.SubscribeDecodedWindow[T](...)` when the workflow has its own typed payloads - use `interop.SubscribeSurfaceSignals(...)` plus `PublishSessionExpired(...)`, `PublishRouteFocus(...)`, `PublishSelection(...)`, or `PublishIntent(...)` when the payload is one of the common session or surface-coordination cases - use cross-tab channels instead of window channels when there is no direct opener or popup relationship', 0.9, 'pass', '', 802, 1449, '- use `interop.OpenSecondaryWindowChannel(...)` in the opener when the current app launches and owns the popup lifecycle - use `interop.WindowOpenerChannel(...)` inside the popup when it needs to talk back to its opener - use `interop.SubscribeDecodedWindow[T](...)` when the workflow has its own typed payloads - use `interop.SubscribeSurfaceSignals(...)` plus `PublishSessionExpired(...)`, `PublishRouteFocus(...)`, `PublishSelection(...)`, or `PublishIntent(...)` when the payload is one of the common session or surface-coordination cases - use cross-tab channels instead of window channels when there is no direct opener or popup relationship', '- use `interop.OpenSecondaryWindowChannel(...)` in the opener when the current app launches and owns the popup lifecycle - use `interop.WindowOpenerChannel(...)` inside the popup when it needs to talk back to its opener - use `interop.SubscribeDecodedWindow[T](...)` when the workflow has its own typed payloads - use `interop.SubscribeSurfaceSignals(...)` plus `PublishSessionExpired(...)`, `PublishRouteFocus(...)`, `PublishSelection(...)`, or `PublishIntent(...)` when the payload is one of the common session or surface-coordination cases - use cross-tab channels instead of window channels when there is no direct opener or popup relationship', 0, 0, 'manual-multi_surface-20260330T214721896Z', '95c999b0f3f975d8728c5aa90bf4dec0741b574b22f95c63a0d3f604cdedab71', '87fd795f9a9af66f3fcc601ba42f03525b6103005451393c228ab3006a933f3b', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
