('7876de5d61735a71a2223b0571a802541c5494d8', 'docs/OFFLINE_MUTATIONS.md', 'Offline Mutation Queueing', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '1. register one-shot Background Sync from an app-owned service worker registration when the browser supports it 2. fall back to a visible manual replay action when it does not 3. let the replay executor signal a conflict through `fetch.NewMutationConflict(...)` 4. resolve that conflict through `ReplayWithOptions(...)` and an application-owned `ConflictHandler` 5. inspect conflict details later through `fetch.GetMutationConflict(err)` when UI or telemetry needs structured branching', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 8786, 9271, '1. register one-shot Background Sync from an app-owned service worker registration when the browser supports it 2. fall back to a visible manual replay action when it does not 3. let the replay executor signal a conflict through `fetch.NewMutationConflict(...)` 4. resolve that conflict through `ReplayWithOptions(...)` and an application-owned `ConflictHandler` 5. inspect conflict details later through `fetch.GetMutationConflict(err)` when UI or telemetry needs structured branching', '1. register one-shot Background Sync from an app-owned service worker registration when the browser supports it 2. fall back to a visible manual replay action when it does not 3. let the replay executor signal a conflict through `fetch.NewMutationConflict(...)` 4. resolve that conflict through `ReplayWithOptions(...)` and an application-owned `ConflictHandler` 5. inspect conflict details later through `fetch.GetMutationConflict(err)` when UI or telemetry needs structured branching', 0.9, 'pass', '', 8786, 9271, '1. register one-shot Background Sync from an app-owned service worker registration when the browser supports it 2. fall back to a visible manual replay action when it does not 3. let the replay executor signal a conflict through `fetch.NewMutationConflict(...)` 4. resolve that conflict through `ReplayWithOptions(...)` and an application-owned `ConflictHandler` 5. inspect conflict details later through `fetch.GetMutationConflict(err)` when UI or telemetry needs structured branching', '1. register one-shot Background Sync from an app-owned service worker registration when the browser supports it 2. fall back to a visible manual replay action when it does not 3. let the replay executor signal a conflict through `fetch.NewMutationConflict(...)` 4. resolve that conflict through `ReplayWithOptions(...)` and an application-owned `ConflictHandler` 5. inspect conflict details later through `fetch.GetMutationConflict(err)` when UI or telemetry needs structured branching', 0, 0, 'manual-offline_mutations-20260330T214721999Z', 'c7817aff6f4da72f02f54dab66395ab84aa7648e7a06480eafc7c9acb32b20bf', '2d71fe2f73874aab18c3b9cbbd891fc4b9ddd5e39ec77ba2b1ff8769e31ee4ac', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
