('ee0c68403bc4ae095cd2cf678af25f46d62347e7', 'docs/PARALLEL_REGION_TROUBLESHOOTING.md', 'Parallel Region Troubleshooting', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '1. Confirm the renderer is registered exactly once. 2. Confirm `RendererID` and `RegionInstanceID` are non-empty. 3. Confirm props are fully serializable. 4. Confirm declared source IDs are valid. 5. Confirm you are not expecting worker-owned DOM behavior yet.', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 267, 527, '1. Confirm the renderer is registered exactly once. 2. Confirm `RendererID` and `RegionInstanceID` are non-empty. 3. Confirm props are fully serializable. 4. Confirm declared source IDs are valid. 5. Confirm you are not expecting worker-owned DOM behavior yet.', '1. Confirm the renderer is registered exactly once. 2. Confirm `RendererID` and `RegionInstanceID` are non-empty. 3. Confirm props are fully serializable. 4. Confirm declared source IDs are valid. 5. Confirm you are not expecting worker-owned DOM behavior yet.', 0.9, 'pass', '', 267, 527, '1. Confirm the renderer is registered exactly once. 2. Confirm `RendererID` and `RegionInstanceID` are non-empty. 3. Confirm props are fully serializable. 4. Confirm declared source IDs are valid. 5. Confirm you are not expecting worker-owned DOM behavior yet.', '1. Confirm the renderer is registered exactly once. 2. Confirm `RendererID` and `RegionInstanceID` are non-empty. 3. Confirm props are fully serializable. 4. Confirm declared source IDs are valid. 5. Confirm you are not expecting worker-owned DOM behavior yet.', 0, 0, 'manual-parallel_region_troubleshooting-20260330T214722029Z', '4c6f32e508642e06ce2df82ca73d01dedde971795112bcc273e52847ab8f307b', 'b627da96eac97c128bb475942cdb8f305a0e7d14b63d133f6aa803eaa5e4ca68', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
