('34dee1b653fd1ceab35ccdb2347e6588b85ec97e', 'docs/PARALLEL_REGION_TROUBLESHOOTING.md', 'Parallel Region Troubleshooting', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '1. Reproduce with the smallest `ui` example or focused package test. 2. Check whether the failure is a public validation error, a transport downgrade, or a recovery fallback. 3. If it is transport- or recovery-related, inspect the runtime2 diagnostics next. 4. Only widen to full app debugging after the focused contract is understood.', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 6024, 6359, '1. Reproduce with the smallest `ui` example or focused package test. 2. Check whether the failure is a public validation error, a transport downgrade, or a recovery fallback. 3. If it is transport- or recovery-related, inspect the runtime2 diagnostics next. 4. Only widen to full app debugging after the focused contract is understood.', '1. Reproduce with the smallest `ui` example or focused package test. 2. Check whether the failure is a public validation error, a transport downgrade, or a recovery fallback. 3. If it is transport- or recovery-related, inspect the runtime2 diagnostics next. 4. Only widen to full app debugging after the focused contract is understood.', 0.9, 'pass', '', 6024, 6359, '1. Reproduce with the smallest `ui` example or focused package test. 2. Check whether the failure is a public validation error, a transport downgrade, or a recovery fallback. 3. If it is transport- or recovery-related, inspect the runtime2 diagnostics next. 4. Only widen to full app debugging after the focused contract is understood.', '1. Reproduce with the smallest `ui` example or focused package test. 2. Check whether the failure is a public validation error, a transport downgrade, or a recovery fallback. 3. If it is transport- or recovery-related, inspect the runtime2 diagnostics next. 4. Only widen to full app debugging after the focused contract is understood.', 0, 0, 'manual-parallel_region_troubleshooting-20260330T214722029Z', '4c6f32e508642e06