('48905de8502bf3c4553fc93435c901703ccad450', 'docs/PRODUCTION_CORRECTNESS.md', 'Production Correctness', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- render and rerender flows commit deterministic DOM updates for the same virtual tree and state history - state, atom, and transition updates converge to the latest intended result without leaving stale pending work behind - portals preserve ownership and cleanup rules when targets change or subtrees unmount - error boundaries recover scoped failures without corrupting surrounding UI state and surface diagnostics with path context - hydration either reuses matching DOM safely or falls back per subtree with explicit diagnostics - mount or unmount churn does not leak subscribers, deferred work, or stale cleanup state across long-lived sessions', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 1996, 2646, '- render and rerender flows commit deterministic DOM updates for the same virtual tree and state history - state, atom, and transition updates converge to the latest intended result without leaving stale pending work behind - portals preserve ownership and cleanup rules when targets change or subtrees unmount - error boundaries recover scoped failures without corrupting surrounding UI state and surface diagnostics with path context - hydration either reuses matching DOM safely or falls back per subtree with explicit diagnostics - mount or unmount churn does not leak subscribers, deferred work, or stale cleanup state across long-lived sessions', '- render and rerender flows commit deterministic DOM updates for the same virtual tree and state history - state, atom, and transition updates converge to the latest intended result without leaving stale pending work behind - portals preserve ownership and cleanup rules when targets change or subtrees unmount - error boundaries recover scoped failures without corrupting surrounding UI state and surface diagnostics with path context - hydration either reuses matching DOM safely or falls back per subtree with expli