('a177cbdaf4db2c86a30777d2da0f56b1074901b0', 'docs/PROJECT_STRUCTURE.md', 'Recommended Project Structure', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- standalone wasm only: keep one client entrypoint under `cmd/web` or `app/`, plus feature folders and a generated asset output directory - request-time SSR or hybrid: add a server entrypoint, keep browser bootstrap separate, and give route, loader, and HTML shell code a stable home under the app integration layer - domain-heavy: keep business logic under `internal/` or another app-private package tree that does not depend on browser-only code - growing beyond a few screens: prefer feature-local folders over one large `components/` or `pages/` dumping ground', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 1041, 1605, '- standalone wasm only: keep one client entrypoint under `cmd/web` or `app/`, plus feature folders and a generated asset output directory - request-time SSR or hybrid: add a server entrypoint, keep browser bootstrap separate, and give route, loader, and HTML shell code a stable home under the app integration layer - domain-heavy: keep business logic under `internal/` or another app-private package tree that does not depend on browser-only code - growing beyond a few screens: prefer feature-local folders over one large `components/` or `pages/` dumping ground', '- standalone wasm only: keep one client entrypoint under `cmd/web` or `app/`, plus feature folders and a generated asset output directory - request-time SSR or hybrid: add a server entrypoint, keep browser bootstrap separate, and give route, loader, and HTML shell code a stable home under the app integration layer - domain-heavy: keep business logic under `internal/` or another app-private package tree that does not depend on browser-only code - growing beyond a few screens: prefer feature-local folders over one large `components/` or `pages/` dumping ground', 0.9, 'pass', '', 1041, 1605, '- standalone wasm only: keep one client entrypoint under `cmd/web` or `app/`, plus feature 