('6aa4e026057234705ec69c791fd1c0b75426d0e9', 'docs/PWA.md', 'PWA and Offline App Support', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- applications provide a web app manifest with app name, icons, start URL, display mode, theme color, and related metadata - manifest generation or templating may live in companion tooling rather than in core rendering APIs; the first shipped helper surface now lives in the `pwa` package through `pwa.Manifest` plus `pwa.MarshalManifestJSON(...)` - SSR, prerender, or static-hosted HTML should reference the manifest explicitly through ordinary head markup', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 4551, 5008, '- applications provide a web app manifest with app name, icons, start URL, display mode, theme color, and related metadata - manifest generation or templating may live in companion tooling rather than in core rendering APIs; the first shipped helper surface now lives in the `pwa` package through `pwa.Manifest` plus `pwa.MarshalManifestJSON(...)` - SSR, prerender, or static-hosted HTML should reference the manifest explicitly through ordinary head markup', '- applications provide a web app manifest with app name, icons, start URL, display mode, theme color, and related metadata - manifest generation or templating may live in companion tooling rather than in core rendering APIs; the first shipped helper surface now lives in the `pwa` package through `pwa.Manifest` plus `pwa.MarshalManifestJSON(...)` - SSR, prerender, or static-hosted HTML should reference the manifest explicitly through ordinary head markup', 0.9, 'pass', '', 4551, 5008, '- applications provide a web app manifest with app name, icons, start URL, display mode, theme color, and related metadata - manifest generation or templating may live in companion tooling rather than in core rendering APIs; the first shipped helper surface now lives in the `pwa` package through `pwa.Manifest` plus `pwa.MarshalManifestJSON(...)` - SSR, prerender, or static-hosted HTML should reference the manifest explicitly