('49a91bfe95e7095f89de5b1d0643745b1896245a', 'docs/PWA.md', 'PWA and Offline App Support', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- shell HTML and offline fallback documents: `network-first` or `stale-while-revalidate`, depending on how aggressively the application wants repeat-visit freshness - hashed wasm, JS helpers, CSS, and fingerprinted media: `cache-first` - non-hashed or correctness-sensitive route data: not part of this helper surface; keep those under app-owned fetch or service-worker logic instead of pretending Cache Storage alone solves data freshness', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 9277, 9716, '- shell HTML and offline fallback documents: `network-first` or `stale-while-revalidate`, depending on how aggressively the application wants repeat-visit freshness - hashed wasm, JS helpers, CSS, and fingerprinted media: `cache-first` - non-hashed or correctness-sensitive route data: not part of this helper surface; keep those under app-owned fetch or service-worker logic instead of pretending Cache Storage alone solves data freshness', '- shell HTML and offline fallback documents: `network-first` or `stale-while-revalidate`, depending on how aggressively the application wants repeat-visit freshness - hashed wasm, JS helpers, CSS, and fingerprinted media: `cache-first` - non-hashed or correctness-sensitive route data: not part of this helper surface; keep those under app-owned fetch or service-worker logic instead of pretending Cache Storage alone solves data freshness', 0.9, 'pass', '', 9277, 9716, '- shell HTML and offline fallback documents: `network-first` or `stale-while-revalidate`, depending on how aggressively the application wants repeat-visit freshness - hashed wasm, JS helpers, CSS, and fingerprinted media: `cache-first` - non-hashed or correctness-sensitive route data: not part of this helper surface; keep those under app-owned fetch or service-worker logic instead of pretending Cache Storage alone solves data freshness', '- shell HTML and offline fallback docum