('fbf39e7ffe5c29d8aec29c226748912273fb44e3', 'docs/PWA.md', 'PWA and Offline App Support', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- `server-wins`: discard or quarantine the local mutation when the server revision already moved and local overwrite is not allowed - `client-wins`: reissue the local mutation intentionally, usually only when the server treats the client write as authoritative and idempotent - `revision-aware reject`: stop replay and surface conflict review when the local base revision is stale - `field-level merge`: synthesize a new mutation draft from compatible local and remote fields, then replay that explicit merged payload - `operator-reviewed`: hold replay until a human picks discard, merge, or overwrite', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 23181, 23782, '- `server-wins`: discard or quarantine the local mutation when the server revision already moved and local overwrite is not allowed - `client-wins`: reissue the local mutation intentionally, usually only when the server treats the client write as authoritative and idempotent - `revision-aware reject`: stop replay and surface conflict review when the local base revision is stale - `field-level merge`: synthesize a new mutation draft from compatible local and remote fields, then replay that explicit merged payload - `operator-reviewed`: hold replay until a human picks discard, merge, or overwrite', '- `server-wins`: discard or quarantine the local mutation when the server revision already moved and local overwrite is not allowed - `client-wins`: reissue the local mutation intentionally, usually only when the server treats the client write as authoritative and idempotent - `revision-aware reject`: stop replay and surface conflict review when the local base revision is stale - `field-level merge`: synthesize a new mutation draft from compatible local and remote fields, then replay that explicit merged payload - `operator-reviewed`: hold replay until a human picks discard, merge, or overwrite', 0.9, 'pass', '', 23181, 