('f67e80dfd04ee83daad3f7a1501ebd8b45ec6b81', 'docs/PWA.md', 'PWA and Offline App Support', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- keep the queue transport and the UI workflow separate; the queue stores intent, but the app chooses how and where to render repair actions - link UI actions back to explicit queue outcomes such as discard, requeue with merge, retry, or open a record-level editor - show conflict reasons in domain language when possible, while preserving the structured technical cause for diagnostics and support - prefer narrow per-record repair over one giant modal whenever only a few entities are conflicted', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 26222, 26719, '- keep the queue transport and the UI workflow separate; the queue stores intent, but the app chooses how and where to render repair actions - link UI actions back to explicit queue outcomes such as discard, requeue with merge, retry, or open a record-level editor - show conflict reasons in domain language when possible, while preserving the structured technical cause for diagnostics and support - prefer narrow per-record repair over one giant modal whenever only a few entities are conflicted', '- keep the queue transport and the UI workflow separate; the queue stores intent, but the app chooses how and where to render repair actions - link UI actions back to explicit queue outcomes such as discard, requeue with merge, retry, or open a record-level editor - show conflict reasons in domain language when possible, while preserving the structured technical cause for diagnostics and support - prefer narrow per-record repair over one giant modal whenever only a few entities are conflicted', 0.9, 'pass', '', 26222, 26719, '- keep the queue transport and the UI workflow separate; the queue stores intent, but the app chooses how and where to render repair actions - link UI actions back to explicit queue outcomes such as discard, requeue with merge, retry, or open a record-level editor - show conflict reasons in domain langu