('6a88381430d06687e837f1006f84f2384a584b0d', 'docs/ROUTER_AUTH.md', 'Router Async Guards And Auth Design', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- `Redirect`: navigate to another internal target instead of completing the requested route - `Blocked`: stop the navigation and keep the current route - `Reason`: optional explanation for diagnostics or app-owned UI - `Denied`: mark the decision as an authorization-style denial instead of a generic block - `Retryable`: identify a transient failure so application UI can offer retry behavior', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 4414, 4807, '- `Redirect`: navigate to another internal target instead of completing the requested route - `Blocked`: stop the navigation and keep the current route - `Reason`: optional explanation for diagnostics or app-owned UI - `Denied`: mark the decision as an authorization-style denial instead of a generic block - `Retryable`: identify a transient failure so application UI can offer retry behavior', '- `Redirect`: navigate to another internal target instead of completing the requested route - `Blocked`: stop the navigation and keep the current route - `Reason`: optional explanation for diagnostics or app-owned UI - `Denied`: mark the decision as an authorization-style denial instead of a generic block - `Retryable`: identify a transient failure so application UI can offer retry behavior', 0.9, 'pass', '', 4414, 4807, '- `Redirect`: navigate to another internal target instead of completing the requested route - `Blocked`: stop the navigation and keep the current route - `Reason`: optional explanation for diagnostics or app-owned UI - `Denied`: mark the decision as an authorization-style denial instead of a generic block - `Retryable`: identify a transient failure so application UI can offer retry behavior', '- `Redirect`: navigate to another internal target instead of completing the requested route - `Blocked`: stop the navigation and keep the current route - `Reason`: optional explanation for diagnostics or app-owned UI - `Denied`: mark the decision as an authorization-style denial instead of a generic block - `Retryable`: identify a transient failure so application UI can offer retry behavior', 0, 0, 'manual-router_auth-20260330T214722106Z', 'db9a6446af37a0d655bbd1ab499a0467bca4e3536feb6d46ede124db7871d585', '71d13240dea69d5dd7bc26411da6f2a6e9bbd1b334eed6ed53bfe5814a44cf12', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
