('326493268b6cb37bdb83fc7a5e8c0693406c783e', 'docs/RPC_TRANSPORT.md', 'Typed RPC and Streaming Transport', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- unary: one request message, one terminal response message - server streaming: one request message, zero or more streamed response messages, then one terminal completion - client streaming: one stream open, zero or more client messages, one explicit client half-close, then one terminal response - bidirectional streaming: one stream open followed by independent client-send and server-send traffic until one side completes or cancels', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 5305, 5740, '- unary: one request message, one terminal response message - server streaming: one request message, zero or more streamed response messages, then one terminal completion - client streaming: one stream open, zero or more client messages, one explicit client half-close, then one terminal response - bidirectional streaming: one stream open followed by independent client-send and server-send traffic until one side completes or cancels', '- unary: one request message, one terminal response message - server streaming: one request message, zero or more streamed response messages, then one terminal completion - client streaming: one stream open, zero or more client messages, one explicit client half-close, then one terminal response - bidirectional streaming: one stream open followed by independent client-send and server-send traffic until one side completes or cancels', 0.9, 'pass', '', 5305, 5740, '- unary: one request message, one terminal response message - server streaming: one request message, zero or more streamed response messages, then one terminal completion - client streaming: one stream open, zero or more client messages, one explicit client half-close, then one terminal response - bidirectional streaming: one stream open followed by independent client-send and server-send traffic until one side completes or cancels', '- unary: one request message, one termi