('31deeab0caf6c8574ed26e3a20efa4eb2fe8586b', 'docs/SERVER_ACTIONS.md', 'Server Actions', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- a server action is a server-owned form mutation endpoint with one typed result envelope - the browser may submit it as a plain form post or through hydrated enhancement - success, redirect, validation failure, auth failure, and retryable failure all use the same action semantics - `ui.UseForm[T]` remains the local field-state owner; the server remains the mutation authority', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 437, 815, '- a server action is a server-owned form mutation endpoint with one typed result envelope - the browser may submit it as a plain form post or through hydrated enhancement - success, redirect, validation failure, auth failure, and retryable failure all use the same action semantics - `ui.UseForm[T]` remains the local field-state owner; the server remains the mutation authority', '- a server action is a server-owned form mutation endpoint with one typed result envelope - the browser may submit it as a plain form post or through hydrated enhancement - success, redirect, validation failure, auth failure, and retryable failure all use the same action semantics - `ui.UseForm[T]` remains the local field-state owner; the server remains the mutation authority', 0.9, 'pass', '', 437, 815, '- a server action is a server-owned form mutation endpoint with one typed result envelope - the browser may submit it as a plain form post or through hydrated enhancement - success, redirect, validation failure, auth failure, and retryable failure all use the same action semantics - `ui.UseForm[T]` remains the local field-state owner; the server remains the mutation authority', '- a server action is a server-owned form mutation endpoint with one typed result envelope - the browser may submit it as a plain form post or through hydrated enhancement - success, redirect, validation failure, auth failure, and retryable failure all use the same action semantics - `ui.U