('1f6ff9c24799e7624d048340986036da73f3e664', 'docs/SERVER_ACTIONS.md', 'Server Actions', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- action identifier or route: the authoritative server endpoint that owns the mutation - request shape: ordinary form fields or multipart payload shaped for progressive browser submission first - auth and CSRF boundary: same-origin session, CSRF validation, and permission checks remain server-owned - typed result envelope: one result model that both HTML-post and hydrated callers can interpret - follow-up instruction: stay in place, redirect, refresh data, or retry later', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 906, 1381, '- action identifier or route: the authoritative server endpoint that owns the mutation - request shape: ordinary form fields or multipart payload shaped for progressive browser submission first - auth and CSRF boundary: same-origin session, CSRF validation, and permission checks remain server-owned - typed result envelope: one result model that both HTML-post and hydrated callers can interpret - follow-up instruction: stay in place, redirect, refresh data, or retry later', '- action identifier or route: the authoritative server endpoint that owns the mutation - request shape: ordinary form fields or multipart payload shaped for progressive browser submission first - auth and CSRF boundary: same-origin session, CSRF validation, and permission checks remain server-owned - typed result envelope: one result model that both HTML-post and hydrated callers can interpret - follow-up instruction: stay in place, redirect, refresh data, or retry later', 0.9, 'pass', '', 906, 1381, '- action identifier or route: the authoritative server endpoint that owns the mutation - request shape: ordinary form fields or multipart payload shaped for progressive browser submission first - auth and CSRF boundary: same-origin session, CSRF validation, and permission checks remain server-owned - typed result envelope: one result model that both HTML-post and hydrated cal