('6410124f378a98092dd2735fa65634e5f0e6f55b', 'docs/SERVER_FUNCTIONS.md', 'Server Functions', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- a server function is an application-owned typed call into same-origin server code - it is broader than a form action because it may represent non-form mutations or explicit query-style commands - it is narrower than a transport framework because it does not turn core GWC into an RPC stack - it should layer on existing public surfaces such as `fetch`, `router`, `ui`, SSR bootstrap, and same-origin auth handling', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 280, 695, '- a server function is an application-owned typed call into same-origin server code - it is broader than a form action because it may represent non-form mutations or explicit query-style commands - it is narrower than a transport framework because it does not turn core GWC into an RPC stack - it should layer on existing public surfaces such as `fetch`, `router`, `ui`, SSR bootstrap, and same-origin auth handling', '- a server function is an application-owned typed call into same-origin server code - it is broader than a form action because it may represent non-form mutations or explicit query-style commands - it is narrower than a transport framework because it does not turn core GWC into an RPC stack - it should layer on existing public surfaces such as `fetch`, `router`, `ui`, SSR bootstrap, and same-origin auth handling', 0.9, 'pass', '', 280, 695, '- a server function is an application-owned typed call into same-origin server code - it is broader than a form action because it may represent non-form mutations or explicit query-style commands - it is narrower than a transport framework because it does not turn core GWC into an RPC stack - it should layer on existing public surfaces such as `fetch`, `router`, `ui`, SSR bootstrap, and same-origin auth handling', '- a server function is an application-owned typed call into same-origin server code - it is broader than a form action because it may rep