('2dc691ec499c1209c5b57b8541753fe0851c93dd', 'docs/SERVER_INTEGRATION.md', 'Server Integration', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '1. top-level HTTP middleware attaches request IDs, logging context, recovery, timeout, session state, and any auth or CSRF context 2. the route handler resolves the current route, request-scoped loader data, and any request-owned view model 3. the handler renders HTML with `ui.RenderToString(...)` or `ui.RenderToStringObserved(...)` 4. the handler embeds or references the bootstrap payload needed for hydration reuse 5. the browser loads the wasm bundle and resumes with `ui.Hydrate(...)` or `router.HydrateMount(...)`', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 2366, 2887, '1. top-level HTTP middleware attaches request IDs, logging context, recovery, timeout, session state, and any auth or CSRF context 2. the route handler resolves the current route, request-scoped loader data, and any request-owned view model 3. the handler renders HTML with `ui.RenderToString(...)` or `ui.RenderToStringObserved(...)` 4. the handler embeds or references the bootstrap payload needed for hydration reuse 5. the browser loads the wasm bundle and resumes with `ui.Hydrate(...)` or `router.HydrateMount(...)`', '1. top-level HTTP middleware attaches request IDs, logging context, recovery, timeout, session state, and any auth or CSRF context 2. the route handler resolves the current route, request-scoped loader data, and any request-owned view model 3. the handler renders HTML with `ui.RenderToString(...)` or `ui.RenderToStringObserved(...)` 4. the handler embeds or references the bootstrap payload needed for hydration reuse 5. the browser loads the wasm bundle and resumes with `ui.Hydrate(...)` or `router.HydrateMount(...)`', 0.9, 'pass', '', 2366, 2887, '1. top-level HTTP middleware attaches request IDs, logging context, recovery, timeout, session state, and any auth or CSRF context 2. the route handler resolves the current route, request-scoped loader data, and any request-owned 