('dda42822de19bb866e955f06b196a91f19eba31c', 'docs/STATE_TRANSFER.md', 'State Transfer', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- use JSON for ordinary route data, form defaults, and cache seed payloads - use text encoding for ids or compact tokens that already have a stable string form - use binary for raw byte slices only when the payload is truly byte-oriented - use CBOR only when both the writer and reader deliberately own a denser typed payload contract - keep secrets, credentials, and other server-only values out of every encoding mode', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 3740, 4159, '- use JSON for ordinary route data, form defaults, and cache seed payloads - use text encoding for ids or compact tokens that already have a stable string form - use binary for raw byte slices only when the payload is truly byte-oriented - use CBOR only when both the writer and reader deliberately own a denser typed payload contract - keep secrets, credentials, and other server-only values out of every encoding mode', '- use JSON for ordinary route data, form defaults, and cache seed payloads - use text encoding for ids or compact tokens that already have a stable string form - use binary for raw byte slices only when the payload is truly byte-oriented - use CBOR only when both the writer and reader deliberately own a denser typed payload contract - keep secrets, credentials, and other server-only values out of every encoding mode', 0.9, 'pass', '', 3740, 4159, '- use JSON for ordinary route data, form defaults, and cache seed payloads - use text encoding for ids or compact tokens that already have a stable string form - use binary for raw byte slices only when the payload is truly byte-oriented - use CBOR only when both the writer and reader deliberately own a denser typed payload contract - keep secrets, credentials, and other server-only values out of every encoding mode', '- use JSON for ordinary route data, form defaults, and cache seed payloads - use text encoding for ids or compact tokens 