('0dc828ed6b7d663c28961f7446b181733a7030ab', 'docs/STATE_TRANSFER.md', 'State Transfer', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- inline JSON: Best for small, public payloads needed immediately at first paint - sidecar JSON: Best when inline script size starts to bloat HTML but JSON readability is still useful - sidecar CBOR: Best when the payload is still public but larger and strongly benefits from a denser binary transport', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 8895, 9202, '- inline JSON: Best for small, public payloads needed immediately at first paint - sidecar JSON: Best when inline script size starts to bloat HTML but JSON readability is still useful - sidecar CBOR: Best when the payload is still public but larger and strongly benefits from a denser binary transport', '- inline JSON: Best for small, public payloads needed immediately at first paint - sidecar JSON: Best when inline script size starts to bloat HTML but JSON readability is still useful - sidecar CBOR: Best when the payload is still public but larger and strongly benefits from a denser binary transport', 0.9, 'pass', '', 8895, 9202, '- inline JSON: Best for small, public payloads needed immediately at first paint - sidecar JSON: Best when inline script size starts to bloat HTML but JSON readability is still useful - sidecar CBOR: Best when the payload is still public but larger and strongly benefits from a denser binary transport', '- inline JSON: Best for small, public payloads needed immediately at first paint - sidecar JSON: Best when inline script size starts to bloat HTML but JSON readability is still useful - sidecar CBOR: Best when the payload is still public but larger and strongly benefits from a denser binary transport', 0, 0, 'manual-state_transfer-20260330T214722218Z', '5016a9d8806678ad646fee1179a1eb2e5d1e4121e1acc8b2ddecb8bd2ab0657c', '8d3e95fa58b589e16e8bda16ba42c0bf446c9c0094352af105da242c90e69f57', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
