('567f186e97ced65781e977fd0244739b04b1bdd2', 'docs/STREAMING_SSR.md', 'Streaming SSR', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- flush one meaningful shell chunk first, not a stream of tiny fragments - use explicit region wrappers or sentinels so later streamed content can be mapped to the right placeholder deterministically - measure behavior with compression on and off, because local uncompressed behavior is often misleading - treat reverse-proxy and CDN configuration as part of the feature contract, not as an afterthought outside the framework - define what happens when buffering defeats incremental flushes: the page should still complete correctly as a normal full response', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 7051, 7609, '- flush one meaningful shell chunk first, not a stream of tiny fragments - use explicit region wrappers or sentinels so later streamed content can be mapped to the right placeholder deterministically - measure behavior with compression on and off, because local uncompressed behavior is often misleading - treat reverse-proxy and CDN configuration as part of the feature contract, not as an afterthought outside the framework - define what happens when buffering defeats incremental flushes: the page should still complete correctly as a normal full response', '- flush one meaningful shell chunk first, not a stream of tiny fragments - use explicit region wrappers or sentinels so later streamed content can be mapped to the right placeholder deterministically - measure behavior with compression on and off, because local uncompressed behavior is often misleading - treat reverse-proxy and CDN configuration as part of the feature contract, not as an afterthought outside the framework - define what happens when buffering defeats incremental flushes: the page should still complete correctly as a normal full response', 0.9, 'pass', '', 7051, 7609, '- flush one meaningful shell chunk first, not a stream of tiny fragments - use explicit region wrappers or sentinels so later str