('3a9dda62fa52e9aa8534120f38770549ec7f82ad', 'docs/VIRTUALIZATION.md', 'Virtualization', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- if diagnostics show the rendered row count drifting above the expected visible-plus-overscan window, treat that as a correctness bug - if a fixed-height list reports non-zero measurement or scroll-correction churn, treat that as a regression - if mount and unmount churn spikes far beyond the number of rows actually entering and leaving the window, inspect key stability and unnecessary full-list rerenders first', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 20654, 21069, '- if diagnostics show the rendered row count drifting above the expected visible-plus-overscan window, treat that as a correctness bug - if a fixed-height list reports non-zero measurement or scroll-correction churn, treat that as a regression - if mount and unmount churn spikes far beyond the number of rows actually entering and leaving the window, inspect key stability and unnecessary full-list rerenders first', '- if diagnostics show the rendered row count drifting above the expected visible-plus-overscan window, treat that as a correctness bug - if a fixed-height list reports non-zero measurement or scroll-correction churn, treat that as a regression - if mount and unmount churn spikes far beyond the number of rows actually entering and leaving the window, inspect key stability and unnecessary full-list rerenders first', 0.9, 'pass', '', 20654, 21069, '- if diagnostics show the rendered row count drifting above the expected visible-plus-overscan window, treat that as a correctness bug - if a fixed-height list reports non-zero measurement or scroll-correction churn, treat that as a regression - if mount and unmount churn spikes far beyond the number of rows actually entering and leaving the window, inspect key stability and unnecessary full-list rerenders first', '- if diagnostics show the rendered row count drifting above the expected visible-plus-overscan window, treat that as a correctness bu