('f762ec826e3c6824fd0e9c3caffdb46bf44c270c', 'docs/VIRTUALIZATION.md', 'Virtualization', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- passing viewport-math regressions for the owned-scroll list contract - passing restoration and hydration regressions for the shipped example surfaces - browser benchmark coverage that compares the virtualized feed against a full-render baseline - stable diagnostics budgets where measurement, invalidation, and scroll-correction churn remain zero for the fixed-height primitive', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 21652, 22031, '- passing viewport-math regressions for the owned-scroll list contract - passing restoration and hydration regressions for the shipped example surfaces - browser benchmark coverage that compares the virtualized feed against a full-render baseline - stable diagnostics budgets where measurement, invalidation, and scroll-correction churn remain zero for the fixed-height primitive', '- passing viewport-math regressions for the owned-scroll list contract - passing restoration and hydration regressions for the shipped example surfaces - browser benchmark coverage that compares the virtualized feed against a full-render baseline - stable diagnostics budgets where measurement, invalidation, and scroll-correction churn remain zero for the fixed-height primitive', 0.9, 'pass', '', 21652, 22031, '- passing viewport-math regressions for the owned-scroll list contract - passing restoration and hydration regressions for the shipped example surfaces - browser benchmark coverage that compares the virtualized feed against a full-render baseline - stable diagnostics budgets where measurement, invalidation, and scroll-correction churn remain zero for the fixed-height primitive', '- passing viewport-math regressions for the owned-scroll list contract - passing restoration and hydration regressions for the shipped example surfaces - browser benchmark coverage that compares the virtualized feed against a full-render baseline - stable diagnostics budgets w