('d60188108c582f810df013b1008bcd8fb781b5ec', 'docs/WASM_RELEASES.md', 'Wasm Build Profiles and Release Engineering', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', 'The PowerShell helper and `gwc release` now emit `wasm-release-manifest.json` containing those size and hash records so builds can be compared mechanically instead of by ad hoc shell output.', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 5585, 5775, 'The PowerShell helper and `gwc release` now emit `wasm-release-manifest.json` containing those size and hash records so builds can be compared mechanically instead of by ad hoc shell output.', 'The PowerShell helper and `gwc release` now emit `wasm-release-manifest.json` containing those size and hash records so builds can be compared mechanically instead of by ad hoc shell output.', 0.9, 'pass', '', 5585, 5775, 'The PowerShell helper and `gwc release` now emit `wasm-release-manifest.json` containing those size and hash records so builds can be compared mechanically instead of by ad hoc shell output.', 'The PowerShell helper and `gwc release` now emit `wasm-release-manifest.json` containing those size and hash records so builds can be compared mechanically instead of by ad hoc shell output.', 0, 0, 'manual-wasm_releases-20260330T214722321Z', '30a6ed13f257b5ab85935440633a8b22d001d8d414ba3e8b0e9e866267982c22', 'f6e15f3470b19e16f89544368412266d000029226cefcb61f25efdee978b38b4', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
('5eade11f5a96ecdee76a876bec2383e125717e46', 'docs/WASM_RELEASES.md', 'Wasm Build Profiles and Release Engineering', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', 'That same manifest is now also the first-class input for service-worker release planning through `pwa.ParseWasmReleaseManifestJSON(...)` and `pwa.BuildServiceWorkerAssetPlan(...)`, so cache namespaces and safe-reload revision checks can reuse the shipped release record instead of maintaining a second wasm-specific PWA manifest.', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 5777, 6106, 'That same manifest is now also the first-class input for service-worker release planning through `pwa.ParseWasmReleaseManifestJSON(...)` and `pwa.BuildServiceWorkerAssetPlan(...)`, so cache namespaces and safe-reload revision checks can reuse the shipped release record instead of maintaining a second wasm-specific PWA manifest.', 'That same manifest is now also the first-class input for service-worker release planning through `pwa.ParseWasmReleaseManifestJSON(...)` and `pwa.BuildServiceWorkerAssetPlan(...)`, so cache namespaces and safe-reload revision checks can reuse the shipped release record instead of maintaining a second wasm-specific PWA manifest.', 0.9, 'pass', '', 5777, 6106, 'That same manifest is now also the first-class input for service-worker release planning through `pwa.ParseWasmReleaseManifestJSON(...)` and `pwa.BuildServiceWorkerAssetPlan(...)`, so cache namespaces and safe-reload revision checks can reuse the shipped release record instead of maintaining a second wasm-specific PWA manifest.', 'That same manifest is now also the first-class input for service-worker release planning through `pwa.ParseWasmReleaseManifestJSON(...)` and `pwa.BuildServiceWorkerAssetPlan(...)`, so cache namespaces and safe-reload revision checks can reuse the shipped release record instead of maintaining a second wasm-specific PWA manifest.', 0, 0, 'manual-wasm_releases-20260330T214722321Z', '30a6ed13f257b5ab85935440633a8b22d001d8d414ba3e8b0e9e866267982c22', '1224509551ef9ce865565a32a0a75bd0c2c649005b74e468d9a71d20a7db58ba', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
