('34452c49ae40c1e8064147649e27084a9ea80a75', 'docs/WORKSPACE_PERSISTENCE.md', 'Workspace Persistence', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '1. resolve auth and determine the active user namespace 2. restore the recent workspace mirror, drafts, canvas state, and scroll markers for that user only 3. render the protected workspace shell 4. reconcile browser-restored state with authoritative server history or route data as those loads complete', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 1490, 1799, '1. resolve auth and determine the active user namespace 2. restore the recent workspace mirror, drafts, canvas state, and scroll markers for that user only 3. render the protected workspace shell 4. reconcile browser-restored state with authoritative server history or route data as those loads complete', '1. resolve auth and determine the active user namespace 2. restore the recent workspace mirror, drafts, canvas state, and scroll markers for that user only 3. render the protected workspace shell 4. reconcile browser-restored state with authoritative server history or route data as those loads complete', 0.9, 'pass', '', 1490, 1799, '1. resolve auth and determine the active user namespace 2. restore the recent workspace mirror, drafts, canvas state, and scroll markers for that user only 3. render the protected workspace shell 4. reconcile browser-restored state with authoritative server history or route data as those loads complete', '1. resolve auth and determine the active user namespace 2. restore the recent workspace mirror, drafts, canvas state, and scroll markers for that user only 3. render the protected workspace shell 4. reconcile browser-restored state with authoritative server history or route data as those loads complete', 0, 0, 'manual-workspace_persistence-20260330T214722347Z', 'b8d3f496c91390f6051157e11f619d9c92639793a16ed124d5668019eb85df5a', 'c322c8317f802fc24af423f33ba81ebc56a7d9df34b428b25fc59c045b4b525f', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
