('415a5fe6eb6df2a0f384638bde8380b478635d76', 'docs\ASSETS.md', 'Assets', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- emit `srcset` and `sizes` when the image has meaningful size variants - provide intrinsic `width` and `height` where possible to preserve layout stability - use `loading="lazy"` for offscreen content rather than above-the-fold hero assets - use `decoding="async"` when it improves scroll or route-transition smoothness and synchronous decode is not required for first paint - use poster images for video and embed placeholders when the full media should not block first paint - treat art-direction variants as explicit application decisions rather than automatic framework behavior', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 7535, 8118, '- emit `srcset` and `sizes` when the image has meaningful size variants - provide intrinsic `width` and `height` where possible to preserve layout stability - use `loading="lazy"` for offscreen content rather than above-the-fold hero assets - use `decoding="async"` when it improves scroll or route-transition smoothness and synchronous decode is not required for first paint - use poster images for video and embed placeholders when the full media should not block first paint - treat art-direction variants as explicit application decisions rather than automatic framework behavior', '- emit `srcset` and `sizes` when the image has meaningful size variants - provide intrinsic `width` and `height` where possible to preserve layout stability - use `loading="lazy"` for offscreen content rather than above-the-fold hero assets - use `decoding="async"` when it improves scroll or route-transition smoothness and synchronous decode is not required for first paint - use poster images for video and embed placeholders when the full media should not block first paint - treat art-direction variants as explicit application decisions rather than automatic framework behavior', 0.9, 'pass', '', 7535, 8118, '- emit `srcset` and `sizes` when the image has meaningful size varia