('2a48a9d0e0170f04c2c2600034746aa9e81533fe', 'docs\AUTH_AND_SESSION_INTEGRATION.md', 'Auth And Session Integration', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '1. public routes, auth routes, and protected workspace routes live in one router tree 2. sign-in submits to a same-origin action or API and receives a new server session or short-lived browser credential 3. the client updates its auth hint in memory and navigates directly into the protected workspace 4. background refresh keeps the session current before expiry while the shell stays mounted 5. sign-out or refresh failure downgrades the same running shell back to public or sign-in routes', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 9318, 9821, '1. public routes, auth routes, and protected workspace routes live in one router tree 2. sign-in submits to a same-origin action or API and receives a new server session or short-lived browser credential 3. the client updates its auth hint in memory and navigates directly into the protected workspace 4. background refresh keeps the session current before expiry while the shell stays mounted 5. sign-out or refresh failure downgrades the same running shell back to public or sign-in routes', '1. public routes, auth routes, and protected workspace routes live in one router tree 2. sign-in submits to a same-origin action or API and receives a new server session or short-lived browser credential 3. the client updates its auth hint in memory and navigates directly into the protected workspace 4. background refresh keeps the session current before expiry while the shell stays mounted 5. sign-out or refresh failure downgrades the same running shell back to public or sign-in routes', 0.9, 'pass', '', 9318, 9821, '1. public routes, auth routes, and protected workspace routes live in one router tree 2. sign-in submits to a same-origin action or API and receives a new server session or short-lived browser credential 3. the client updates its auth hint in memory and navigates directly into the protected workspace 4. background refresh keeps the session current before expiry while the shell stays mounted 5. sign-out or refresh failure downgrades the same running shell back to public or sign-in routes', '1. public routes, auth routes, and protected workspace routes live in one router tree 2. sign-in submits to a same-origin action or API and receives a new server session or short-lived browser credential 3. the client updates its auth hint in memory and navigates directly into the protected workspace 4. background refresh keeps the session current before expiry while the shell stays mounted 5. sign-out or refresh failure downgrades the same running shell back to public or sign-in routes', 0, 0, 'manual-auth_and_session_integration-20260330T214856010Z', '4eb2ea679eca5950f4d9d438ff13c5e245ade6fc580b182d7b3ae7a01bd3a510', '6c883c81c35d948a506c33e081664e9f0dd29e80dc0519966eb7f35b45d04f4b', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
