('e092eba1dbb42a149c21f5dea15bdd03ebf48553', 'docs\CACHE.md', 'Shared Cache Design', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- `CacheOptions.StaleAfter` - `CacheOptions.MaxAge` - `CacheOptions.DisposeAfter` - `CacheOptions.Persist`', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 3665, 3771, '- `CacheOptions.StaleAfter` - `CacheOptions.MaxAge` - `CacheOptions.DisposeAfter` - `CacheOptions.Persist`', '- `CacheOptions.StaleAfter` - `CacheOptions.MaxAge` - `CacheOptions.DisposeAfter` - `CacheOptions.Persist`', 0.9, 'pass', '', 3665, 3771, '- `CacheOptions.StaleAfter` - `CacheOptions.MaxAge` - `CacheOptions.DisposeAfter` - `CacheOptions.Persist`', '- `CacheOptions.StaleAfter` - `CacheOptions.MaxAge` - `CacheOptions.DisposeAfter` - `CacheOptions.Persist`', 0, 0, 'manual-cache-20260330T214856081Z', '1e4fdf979005e827fc0eff3d189fe6140b80823a5c21ede3b573b92bceee754c', '2ea2c6793ebf5d447d48a824c5137338db0624d9b3b6dcc33ac37bf069e498e4', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
('d4e19c523d16e70b5797df29f840324845187e17', 'docs\CACHE.md', 'Shared Cache Design', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- when `StaleAfter` is unset, the cache stays fresh until explicit invalidation or reload - when `StaleAfter` expires, the next subscriber or reload path may revalidate the key - stale ready data remains visible during background reload - when `MaxAge` expires, the ready snapshot is cleared and the next reader reloads cold - when `DisposeAfter` expires, `SweepCachedResources()` or the next access clears the entry - when `Persist` is enabled, ready values are written through to durable browser storage and a later session restores that same key before a cold load begins - applications may explicitly clear one entry with `DisposeResource(key)` or `resource.Dispose()`', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 3792, 4464, '- when `StaleAfter` is unset, the cache stays fresh until explicit invalidation or reload - when `StaleAfter` expires, the next subscriber or reload path may revalidate the key - stale ready data remains visible during background reload - when `MaxAge` expires, the ready snapshot is cleared and the next reader reloads cold - when `DisposeAfter` expires, `SweepCachedResources()` or the next access clears the entry - when `Persist` is enabled, ready values are written through to durable browser storage and a later session restores that same key before a cold load begins - applications may explicitly clear one entry with `DisposeResource(key)` or `resource.Dispose()`', '- when `StaleAfter` is unset, the cache stays fresh until explicit invalidation or reload - when `StaleAfter` expires, the next subscriber or reload path may revalidate the key - stale ready data remains visible during background reload - when `MaxAge` expires, the ready snapshot is cleared and the next reader reloads cold - when `DisposeAfter` expires, `SweepCachedResources()` or the next access clears the entry - when `Persist` is enabled, ready values are written through to durable browser storage and a later session restores that same key before a cold load begins - applications may explicitly clear one entry with `DisposeResource(key)` or `resource.Dispose()`', 0.9, 'pass', '', 3792, 4464, '- when `StaleAfter` is unset, the cache stays fresh until explicit invalidation or reload - when `StaleAfter` expires, the next subscriber or reload path may revalidate the key - stale ready data remains visible during background reload - when `MaxAge` expires, the ready snapshot is cleared and the next reader reloads cold - when `DisposeAfter` expires, `SweepCachedResources()` or the next access clears the entry - when `Persist` is enabled, ready values are written through to durable browser storage and a later session restores that same key before a cold load begins - applications may explicitly clear one entry with `DisposeResource(key)` or `resource.Dispose()`', '- when `StaleAfter` is unset, the cache stays fresh until explicit invalidation or reload - when `StaleAfter` expires, the next subscriber or reload path may revalidate the key - stale ready data remains visible during background reload - when `MaxAge` expires, the ready snapshot is cleared and the next reader reloads cold - when `DisposeAfter` expires, `SweepCachedResources()` or the next access clears the entry - when `Persist` is enabled, ready values are written through to durable browser storage and a later session restores that same key before a cold load begins - applications may explicitly clear one entry with `DisposeResource(key)` or `resource.Dispose()`', 0, 0, 'manual-cache-20260330T214856081Z', '1e4fdf979005e827fc0eff3d189fe6140b80823a5c21ede3b573b92bceee754c', 'b9f0d169c8a802b7feaaa8548c64d9b077deac261f1c611d9682b1b8e297f376', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
