('3864ce1057a5b444e1928b37c71f5464978399f4', 'docs\CLIENT_SHELL_ROUTING.md', 'Single-Shell Routing Patterns', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- one top-level app shell mounts once and remains active across all route transitions - auth state changes do not swap HTML documents or bootstrap a second wasm runtime - public pages, auth pages, and workspace pages are route branches, not separate apps - global providers (session, i18n, theme, telemetry, mutation queue, cache) are initialized once', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 905, 1256, '- one top-level app shell mounts once and remains active across all route transitions - auth state changes do not swap HTML documents or bootstrap a second wasm runtime - public pages, auth pages, and workspace pages are route branches, not separate apps - global providers (session, i18n, theme, telemetry, mutation queue, cache) are initialized once', '- one top-level app shell mounts once and remains active across all route transitions - auth state changes do not swap HTML documents or bootstrap a second wasm runtime - public pages, auth pages, and workspace pages are route branches, not separate apps - global providers (session, i18n, theme, telemetry, mutation queue, cache) are initialized once', 0.9, 'pass', '', 905, 1256, '- one top-level app shell mounts once and remains active across all route transitions - auth state changes do not swap HTML documents or bootstrap a second wasm runtime - public pages, auth pages, and workspace pages are route branches, not separate apps - global providers (session, i18n, theme, telemetry, mutation queue, cache) are initialized once', '- one top-level app shell mounts once and remains active across all route transitions - auth state changes do not swap HTML documents or bootstrap a second wasm runtime - public pages, auth pages, and workspace pages are route branches, not separate apps - global providers (session, i18n, theme, telemetry, mutation queue, cache) are initialized once', 0, 0, 'manual-client