('05a5831d3e7b74d6b5c9eb5cdaaac2e6ead688f8', 'docs\CODE_SPLITTING.md', 'Code Splitting And Bundle Loading', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- the initial shell still covers first paint and first interaction for the starting route - route splits map to meaningful user journeys rather than arbitrary file boundaries - each lazy subtree has an intentional pending fallback and local recovery path - emitted chunks are resolved only through a manifest or equivalent lookup layer - SSR and prerender know which critical chunks belong to the resolved route family - preload or prefetch behavior is selective and measurable rather than blanket eager loading', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 4228, 4739, '- the initial shell still covers first paint and first interaction for the starting route - route splits map to meaningful user journeys rather than arbitrary file boundaries - each lazy subtree has an intentional pending fallback and local recovery path - emitted chunks are resolved only through a manifest or equivalent lookup layer - SSR and prerender know which critical chunks belong to the resolved route family - preload or prefetch behavior is selective and measurable rather than blanket eager loading', '- the initial shell still covers first paint and first interaction for the starting route - route splits map to meaningful user journeys rather than arbitrary file boundaries - each lazy subtree has an intentional pending fallback and local recovery path - emitted chunks are resolved only through a manifest or equivalent lookup layer - SSR and prerender know which critical chunks belong to the resolved route family - preload or prefetch behavior is selective and measurable rather than blanket eager loading', 0.9, 'pass', '', 4228, 4739, '- the initial shell still covers first paint and first interaction for the starting route - route splits map to meaningful user journeys rather than arbitrary file boundaries - each lazy subtree has an intentional pending fallback and local recovery