ion-development model - bounded compiler-assisted workflows may continue as companion-tool or example-level experiments when they emit inspectable output and preserve the normal runtime contract', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 14285, 14675, '- plain Go remains the supported default authoring path - template-first authoring is not part of the supported default product story today - compiler-first optimization is not a required application-development model - bounded compiler-assisted workflows may continue as companion-tool or example-level experiments when they emit inspectable output and preserve the normal runtime contract', '- plain Go remains the supported default authoring path - template-first authoring is not part of the supported default product story today - compiler-first optimization is not a required application-development model - bounded compiler-assisted workflows may continue as companion-tool or example-level experiments when they emit inspectable output and preserve the normal runtime contract', 0.9, 'pass', '', 14285, 14675, '- plain Go remains the supported default authoring path - template-first authoring is not part of the supported default product story today - compiler-first optimization is not a required application-development model - bounded compiler-assisted workflows may continue as companion-tool or example-level experiments when they emit inspectable output and preserve the normal runtime contract', '- plain Go remains the supported default authoring path - template-first authoring is not part of the supported default product story today - compiler-first optimization is not a required application-development model - bounded compiler-assisted workflows may continue as companion-tool or example-level experiments when they emit inspectable output and preserve the normal runtime contract', 0, 0, 'manual-compiler_assisted_features-20260330T214856115Z', '7484edc0a29fb3d94a1207c6d4b5cdb5c1349c6f43642f6866e9625ef082e46c', 'db288adb07a2dad1f63d70ca8e