('7a5a56282911ece6428c5066633611495e57f182', 'docs\CUSTOM_ELEMENTS.md', 'Custom Elements', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '`examples/89-exported-custom-element` demonstrates the current exploratory pattern for exposing a GoWebComponents subtree as a standards-based custom element:', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 5162, 5320, '`examples/89-exported-custom-element` demonstrates the current exploratory pattern for exposing a GoWebComponents subtree as a standards-based custom element:', '`examples/89-exported-custom-element` demonstrates the current exploratory pattern for exposing a GoWebComponents subtree as a standards-based custom element:', 0.9, 'pass', '', 5162, 5320, '`examples/89-exported-custom-element` demonstrates the current exploratory pattern for exposing a GoWebComponents subtree as a standards-based custom element:', '`examples/89-exported-custom-element` demonstrates the current exploratory pattern for exposing a GoWebComponents subtree as a standards-based custom element:', 0, 0, 'manual-custom_elements-20260330T214856145Z', '1676980ee6589db3114df2ac6c9d8986b815543aecded47eb464b66e388bca41', '073856fab0b067729029c0ab4674de92461d30121c7fc1fe8f51b8a1dfa1c5c3', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
('39c7c0d2104baa05881cb8749049fac3bd4686a1', 'docs\CUSTOM_ELEMENTS.md', 'Custom Elements', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '1. A browser custom-element class owns `connectedCallback`, `attributeChangedCallback`, `disconnectedCallback`, and optional `attachShadow(...)`. 2. That wrapper calls into Go through a narrow mount bridge. 3. Go renders into the wrapper-owned root with `ui.RenderInto(...)`. 4. Disconnect cleanup renders an empty tree back into that same root.', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 5322, 5667, '1. A browser custom-element class owns `connectedCallback`, `attributeChangedCallback`, `disconnectedCallback`, and optional `attachShadow(...)`. 2. That wrapper calls into Go through a narrow mount bridge. 3. Go renders into the wrapper-owned root with `ui.RenderInto(...)`. 4. Disconnect cleanup renders an empty tree back into that same root.', '1. A browser custom-element class owns `connectedCallback`, `attributeChangedCallback`, `disconnectedCallback`, and optional `attachShadow(...)`. 2. That wrapper calls into Go through a narrow mount bridge. 3. Go renders into the wrapper-owned root with `ui.RenderInto(...)`. 4. Disconnect cleanup renders an empty tree back into that same root.', 0.9, 'pass', '', 5322, 5667, '1. A browser custom-element class owns `connectedCallback`, `attributeChangedCallback`, `disconnectedCallback`, and optional `attachShadow(...)`. 2. That wrapper calls into Go through a narrow mount bridge. 3. Go renders into the wrapper-owned root with `ui.RenderInto(...)`. 4. Disconnect cleanup renders an empty tree back into that same root.', '1. A browser custom-element class owns `connectedCallback`, `attributeChangedCallback`, `disconnectedCallback`, and optional `attachShadow(...)`. 2. That wrapper calls into Go through a narrow mount bridge. 3. Go renders into the wrapper-owned root with `ui.RenderInto(...)`. 4. Disconnect cleanup renders an empty tree back into that same root.', 0, 0, 'manual-custom_elements-20260330T214856145Z', '1676980ee6589d