('94cd946b05667666e19eccb26093fba098a3883a', 'docs\DOC_INGESTION_PLAN.md', 'DOC INGESTION PLAN', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', 'Scope rules: - ingest by discovered repo-relative path only - store doc_path as a repo-relative path - treat listed docs/*.md files as eligible by default - allow future docs/ additions to be ingested automatically if they match ingestion rules - manage exclusions through explicit allow/deny rules, not ad hoc skipping', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 980, 1299, 'Scope rules: - ingest by discovered repo-relative path only - store doc_path as a repo-relative path - treat listed docs/*.md files as eligible by default - allow future docs/ additions to be ingested automatically if they match ingestion rules - manage exclusions through explicit allow/deny rules, not ad hoc skipping', 'Scope rules: - ingest by discovered repo-relative path only - store doc_path as a repo-relative path - treat listed docs/*.md files as eligible by default - allow future docs/ additions to be ingested automatically if they match ingestion rules - manage exclusions through explicit allow/deny rules, not ad hoc skipping', 0.9, 'pass', '', 980, 1299, 'Scope rules: - ingest by discovered repo-relative path only - store doc_path as a repo-relative path - treat listed docs/*.md files as eligible by default - allow future docs/ additions to be ingested automatically if they match ingestion rules - manage exclusions through explicit allow/deny rules, not ad hoc skipping', 'Scope rules: - ingest by discovered repo-relative path only - store doc_path as a repo-relative path - treat listed docs/*.md files as eligible by default - allow future docs/ additions to be ingested automatically if they match ingestion rules - manage exclusions through explicit allow/deny rules, not ad hoc skipping', 0, 0, 'manual-doc_ingestion_plan-20260330T214856170Z', '3b885331648432ed029bf50ef9a055a0842f6003cc0a8bee05eafb43dbc14131', 'e421644d7b9e05a6f72d1ce443866005ed84f0a4f5d0350df0046b9f2116c906', 1,