('f664658ee595cdd5d3e8abf4ec82fc1326fb0556', 'docs\DOC_INGESTION_PLAN.md', 'DOC INGESTION PLAN', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', 'Rules - no evidence, no pass for factual or operational claims - overstated wording must be downgraded - bundled multi-claim concepts should be split or marked needs_review - API, config, and command descriptions must stay close to source behavior - headings do not count as proof of semantic claims beneath them - code-derived explanations are high-risk unless directly stated or trivially obvious', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 12641, 13039, 'Rules - no evidence, no pass for factual or operational claims - overstated wording must be downgraded - bundled multi-claim concepts should be split or marked needs_review - API, config, and command descriptions must stay close to source behavior - headings do not count as proof of semantic claims beneath them - code-derived explanations are high-risk unless directly stated or trivially obvious', 'Rules - no evidence, no pass for factual or operational claims - overstated wording must be downgraded - bundled multi-claim concepts should be split or marked needs_review - API, config, and command descriptions must stay close to source behavior - headings do not count as proof of semantic claims beneath them - code-derived explanations are high-risk unless directly stated or trivially obvious', 0.9, 'pass', '', 12641, 13039, 'Rules - no evidence, no pass for factual or operational claims - overstated wording must be downgraded - bundled multi-claim concepts should be split or marked needs_review - API, config, and command descriptions must stay close to source behavior - headings do not count as proof of semantic claims beneath them - code-derived explanations are high-risk unless directly stated or trivially obvious', 'Rules - no evidence, no pass for factual or operational claims - overstated wording must be downgraded - bundled multi-claim concepts should be split or marked needs_review - API, config, and command descriptions must stay close to source behavior - headings do not count as proof of semantic claims beneath them - code-derived explanations are high-risk unless directly stated or trivially obvious', 0, 0, 'manual-doc_ingestion_plan-20260330T214856170Z', '3b885331648432ed029bf50ef9a055a0842f6003cc0a8bee05eafb43dbc14131', '00cd20d76be8f33e95cbc7e63add09637c065e312b1d966d6b0c38b9b69b1871', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
