('5f6744c04a733cc3ff113c42b67cd25a2f76a56b', 'docs\HOT_RELOAD.md', 'Hot Reload', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- add `hotreload.Enable()` to a standalone wasm app during development - switch to `hotreload.Configure(...)` when you need an atom allowlist or explicit reset behavior - start the loop with `go run ./tools/gwc dev -app .\path\to\main.go` - treat `go run ./tools/livereload ...` as the lower-level entrypoint rather than the primary documented workflow', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 891, 1243, '- add `hotreload.Enable()` to a standalone wasm app during development - switch to `hotreload.Configure(...)` when you need an atom allowlist or explicit reset behavior - start the loop with `go run ./tools/gwc dev -app .\path\to\main.go` - treat `go run ./tools/livereload ...` as the lower-level entrypoint rather than the primary documented workflow', '- add `hotreload.Enable()` to a standalone wasm app during development - switch to `hotreload.Configure(...)` when you need an atom allowlist or explicit reset behavior - start the loop with `go run ./tools/gwc dev -app .\path\to\main.go` - treat `go run ./tools/livereload ...` as the lower-level entrypoint rather than the primary documented workflow', 0.9, 'pass', '', 891, 1243, '- add `hotreload.Enable()` to a standalone wasm app during development - switch to `hotreload.Configure(...)` when you need an atom allowlist or explicit reset behavior - start the loop with `go run ./tools/gwc dev -app .\path\to\main.go` - treat `go run ./tools/livereload ...` as the lower-level entrypoint rather than the primary documented workflow', '- add `hotreload.Enable()` to a standalone wasm app during development - switch to `hotreload.Configure(...)` when you need an atom allowlist or explicit reset behavior - start the loop with `go run ./tools/gwc dev -app .\path\to\main.go` - treat `go run ./tools/livereload ...` as the lower-level entrypoint rather than the primary documented workflow', 0, 0, 'manual-hot_reload-20260330T214856281Z