('bcc65ff7dd0d870c614464c2acba191f05d0eb03', 'docs\HOT_RELOAD.md', 'Hot Reload', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', 'The browser bridge now also exposes restore outcomes and hot-reload diagnostics so the live-reload UI can show whether a rebuild restored state, intentionally reset it because `ResetKey` changed, or fell back to remounting part of the tree.', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 4004, 4244, 'The browser bridge now also exposes restore outcomes and hot-reload diagnostics so the live-reload UI can show whether a rebuild restored state, intentionally reset it because `ResetKey` changed, or fell back to remounting part of the tree.', 'The browser bridge now also exposes restore outcomes and hot-reload diagnostics so the live-reload UI can show whether a rebuild restored state, intentionally reset it because `ResetKey` changed, or fell back to remounting part of the tree.', 0.9, 'pass', '', 4004, 4244, 'The browser bridge now also exposes restore outcomes and hot-reload diagnostics so the live-reload UI can show whether a rebuild restored state, intentionally reset it because `ResetKey` changed, or fell back to remounting part of the tree.', 'The browser bridge now also exposes restore outcomes and hot-reload diagnostics so the live-reload UI can show whether a rebuild restored state, intentionally reset it because `ResetKey` changed, or fell back to remounting part of the tree.', 0, 0, 'manual-hot_reload-20260330T214856281Z', '77639bd1a56c2c1a0e718e3dd8cccb376209acbe77e80b558c429b4055dd15f4', 'e0e1323680f9eb7c5aecf52e6fcc3205950a1cc51bb399b210e157b95ed5d514', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
('d5431ab522bada204e164a3a0efcc5febc618a64', 'docs\HOT_RELOAD.md', 'Hot Reload', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', 'The same bridge now exposes recent route and async restart activity, including router loader and guard logs plus explicit pending-fetch restart notices recorded during hot reload prepare.', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 4246, 4433, 'The same bridge now exposes recent route and async restart activity, including router loader and guard logs plus explicit pending-fetch restart notices recorded during hot reload prepare.', 'The same bridge now exposes recent route and async restart activity, including router loader and guard logs plus explicit pending-fetch restart notices recorded during hot reload prepare.', 0.9, 'pass', '', 4246, 4433, 'The same bridge now exposes recent route and async restart activity, including router loader and guard logs plus explicit pending-fetch restart notices recorded during hot reload prepare.', 'The same bridge now exposes recent route and async restart activity, including router loader and guard logs plus explicit pending-fetch restart notices recorded during hot reload prepare.', 0, 0, 'manual-hot_reload-20260330T214856281Z', '77639bd1a56c2c1a0e718e3dd8cccb376209acbe77e80b558c429b4055dd15f4', '2596fbeb16988f8ff685504d95165bbf208dd683b94d4aa6d848c672cbee597b', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
('0385fc7880ee0e000d5cc2fb1d7ae57c29a37a70', 'docs\HOT_RELOAD.md', 'Hot Reload', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', 'During rebuilds, the live-reload UI now also shows a pre-reload compatibility plan before the new bundle swaps in. That plan reports whether the incoming edit is expected to preserve compatible local state, remount changed subtrees, restart router or async work, or force a full reload so the next reload step is explicit instead of heuristic.', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 4435, 4778, 'During rebuilds, the live-reload UI now also shows a pre-reload compatibility plan before the new bundle swaps in. That plan reports whether the incoming edit is expected to preserve compatible local state, remount changed subtrees, restart router or async work, or force a full reload so the next reload step is explicit instead of heuristic.', 'During rebuilds, the live-reload UI now also shows a pre-reload compatibility plan before the new bundle swaps in. That plan reports whether the incoming edit is expected to preserve compatible local state, remount changed subtrees, restart router or async work, or force a full reload so the next reload step is explicit instead of heuristic.', 0.9, 'pass', '', 4435, 4778, 'During rebuilds, the live-reload UI now also shows a pre-reload compatibility plan before the new bundle swaps in. That plan reports whether the incoming edit is expected to preserve compatible local state, remount changed subtrees, restart router or async work, or force a full reload so the next reload step is explicit instead of heuristic.', 'During rebuilds, the live-reload UI now also shows a pre-reload compatibility plan before the new bundle swaps in. That plan reports whether the incoming edit is expected to preserve compatible local state, remount changed subtrees, restart router or async work, or force a full reload so the next reload step is explicit instead of heuristic.', 0, 0, 'manual-hot_reload-20260330T214856281Z', '77639bd1a56c2c1a0e718e3dd8cccb376209acbe77e80b558c429b4055dd15f4', '1173daaf95e70e89f058c459d57a3698407bf994994c660f3f43d373c18daf80', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
('89f5b2fdb4249c6737000d89321011715a1b2d4f', 'docs\HOT_RELOAD.md', 'Hot Reload', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', 'For subtree-scoped resets, wrap a section in `ui.HotReloadBoundary(...)` and change its `ResetKeys` when that part of the tree should intentionally remount on the next hot reload without forcing an app-wide `ResetKey` bump.', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 4780, 5003, 'For subtree-scoped resets, wrap a section in `ui.HotReloadBoundary(...)` and change its `ResetKeys` when that part of the tree should intentionally remount on the next hot reload without forcing an app-wide `ResetKey` bump.', 'For subtree-scoped resets, wrap a section in `ui.HotReloadBoundary(...)` and change its `ResetKeys` when that part of the tree should intentionally remount on the next hot reload without forcing an app-wide `ResetKey` bump.', 0.9, 'pass', '', 4780, 5003, 'For subtree-scoped resets, wrap a section in `ui.HotReloadBoundary(...)` and change its `ResetKeys` when that part of the tree should intentionally remount on the next hot reload without forcing an app-wide `ResetKey` bump.', 'For subtree-scoped resets, wrap a section in `ui.HotReloadBoundary(...)` and change its `ResetKeys` when that part of the tree should intentionally remount on the next hot reload without forcing an app-wide `ResetKey` bump.', 0, 0, 'manual-hot_reload-20260330T214856281Z', '77639bd1a56c2c1a0e718e3dd8cccb376209acbe77e80b558c429b4055dd15f4', 'cce14d5992456ec3e7cee7ce4839cb65cb6b64127a5e215c0fd7e2e535989fe5', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
