('86f7098e44c23eba4a2c385c41a1e265b512f769', 'docs\HYDRATION.md', 'Hydration', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- render HTML on the server with `ui.RenderToString(...)` - emit bootstrap state only for data the client actually needs during resume - call `ui.Hydrate(...)` in the browser with `HydrationOptions` when bootstrap, strict mode, or observability matter - use strict hydration in tests or development when you want mismatches to fail fast instead of quietly degrading to warnings and subtree fallback', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 931, 1329, '- render HTML on the server with `ui.RenderToString(...)` - emit bootstrap state only for data the client actually needs during resume - call `ui.Hydrate(...)` in the browser with `HydrationOptions` when bootstrap, strict mode, or observability matter - use strict hydration in tests or development when you want mismatches to fail fast instead of quietly degrading to warnings and subtree fallback', '- render HTML on the server with `ui.RenderToString(...)` - emit bootstrap state only for data the client actually needs during resume - call `ui.Hydrate(...)` in the browser with `HydrationOptions` when bootstrap, strict mode, or observability matter - use strict hydration in tests or development when you want mismatches to fail fast instead of quietly degrading to warnings and subtree fallback', 0.9, 'pass', '', 931, 1329, '- render HTML on the server with `ui.RenderToString(...)` - emit bootstrap state only for data the client actually needs during resume - call `ui.Hydrate(...)` in the browser with `HydrationOptions` when bootstrap, strict mode, or observability matter - use strict hydration in tests or development when you want mismatches to fail fast instead of quietly degrading to warnings and subtree fallback', '- render HTML on the server with `ui.RenderToString(...)` - emit bootstrap state only for data the client actually needs during resume - call `ui.Hydrate(...)` in the browser with `HydrationOptions` when bootstrap, st