('956b314304a5197d48b8b679166341c38ecd22de', 'docs\HYDRATION.md', 'Hydration', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- text and attribute mismatches warn and continue with the client commit owning the final DOM - structural mismatches abort reuse for the current hydration boundary and fall back to client rendering for that subtree - unexpected trailing nodes are removed with a warning once the matched boundary finishes', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 7455, 7760, '- text and attribute mismatches warn and continue with the client commit owning the final DOM - structural mismatches abort reuse for the current hydration boundary and fall back to client rendering for that subtree - unexpected trailing nodes are removed with a warning once the matched boundary finishes', '- text and attribute mismatches warn and continue with the client commit owning the final DOM - structural mismatches abort reuse for the current hydration boundary and fall back to client rendering for that subtree - unexpected trailing nodes are removed with a warning once the matched boundary finishes', 0.9, 'pass', '', 7455, 7760, '- text and attribute mismatches warn and continue with the client commit owning the final DOM - structural mismatches abort reuse for the current hydration boundary and fall back to client rendering for that subtree - unexpected trailing nodes are removed with a warning once the matched boundary finishes', '- text and attribute mismatches warn and continue with the client commit owning the final DOM - structural mismatches abort reuse for the current hydration boundary and fall back to client rendering for that subtree - unexpected trailing nodes are removed with a warning once the matched boundary finishes', 0, 0, 'manual-hydration-20260330T214856310Z', 'f4aa3cc9fdff8e4443060281483a69ca49fb808b844bbfb00a9d0ddadb0731f0', '2e6b0850fc64e92fc801a83d41f496b8d023e99082ed36146f0ab178039427b9', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
('39ed2cfc292f65253313b896e43285c944bf7b98', 'docs\HYDRATION.md', 'Hydration', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- `ui.HydrationOptions{Strict: true}` turns hydration mismatches into fail-fast errors instead of warning and continuing. - Strict mode is intended for tests and development runs where a fallback or silent DOM rewrite would hide a real SSR contract bug. - In strict mode, text mismatches, attribute mismatches, structural mismatches, and unexpected trailing nodes all stop the hydration pass at the first mismatch. - Strict mode uses the same diagnostic surface, but mismatch entries are emitted as errors instead of warnings before the panic.', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 7788, 8331, '- `ui.HydrationOptions{Strict: true}` turns hydration mismatches into fail-fast errors instead of warning and continuing. - Strict mode is intended for tests and development runs where a fallback or silent DOM rewrite would hide a real SSR contract bug. - In strict mode, text mismatches, attribute mismatches, structural mismatches, and unexpected trailing nodes all stop the hydration pass at the first mismatch. - Strict mode uses the same diagnostic surface, but mismatch entries are emitted as errors instead of warnings before the panic.', '- `ui.HydrationOptions{Strict: true}` turns hydration mismatches into fail-fast errors instead of warning and continuing. - Strict mode is intended for tests and development runs where a fallback or silent DOM rewrite would hide a real SSR contract bug. - In strict mode, text mismatches, attribute mismatches, structural mismatches, and unexpected trailing nodes all stop the hydration pass at the first mismatch. - Strict mode uses the same diagnostic surface, but mismatch entries are emitted as errors instead of warnings before the panic.', 0.9, 'pass', '', 7788, 8331, '- `ui.HydrationOptions{Strict: true}` turns hydration mismatches into fail-fast errors instead of warning and continuing. - Strict mode is intended for tests and development runs where a fallback or silent DOM rewrite would hide a real SSR contract bug. - In strict mode, text mismatches, attribute mismatches, structural mismatches, and unexpected trailing nodes all stop the hydration pass at the first mismatch. - Strict mode uses the same diagnostic surface, but mismatch entries are emitted as errors instead of warnings before the panic.', '- `ui.HydrationOptions{Strict: true}` turns hydration mismatches into fail-fast errors instead of warning and continuing. - Strict mode is intended for tests and development runs where a fallback or silent DOM rewrite would hide a real SSR contract bug. - In strict mode, text mismatches, attribute mismatches, structural mismatches, and unexpected trailing nodes all stop the hydration pass at the first mismatch. - Strict mode uses the same diagnostic surface, but mismatch entries are emitted as errors instead of warnings before the panic.', 0, 0, 'manual-hydration-20260330T214856310Z', 'f4aa3cc9fdff8e4443060281483a69ca49fb808b844bbfb00a9d0ddadb0731f0', 'af1c0aad039dfff994ecbe73df34e990257ca35d328c932cb1a47de35169bbbd', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
