('f6df63217db6dece6f3dd50d225403b11593ecd8', 'docs\HYDRATION.md', 'Hydration', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- valid matching markup should reuse DOM and hydrate normally - text and attribute mismatches degrade to warnings plus client-owned final DOM updates - structural mismatches degrade to subtree replacement, not whole-app restart by default - hydration mismatch recovery is not rendered through `ui.ErrorBoundary` fallback UI - strict hydration is opt-in for development and test workflows, not the default production mode', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 8408, 8828, '- valid matching markup should reuse DOM and hydrate normally - text and attribute mismatches degrade to warnings plus client-owned final DOM updates - structural mismatches degrade to subtree replacement, not whole-app restart by default - hydration mismatch recovery is not rendered through `ui.ErrorBoundary` fallback UI - strict hydration is opt-in for development and test workflows, not the default production mode', '- valid matching markup should reuse DOM and hydrate normally - text and attribute mismatches degrade to warnings plus client-owned final DOM updates - structural mismatches degrade to subtree replacement, not whole-app restart by default - hydration mismatch recovery is not rendered through `ui.ErrorBoundary` fallback UI - strict hydration is opt-in for development and test workflows, not the default production mode', 0.9, 'pass', '', 8408, 8828, '- valid matching markup should reuse DOM and hydrate normally - text and attribute mismatches degrade to warnings plus client-owned final DOM updates - structural mismatches degrade to subtree replacement, not whole-app restart by default - hydration mismatch recovery is not rendered through `ui.ErrorBoundary` fallback UI - strict hydration is opt-in for development and test workflows, not the default production mode', '- valid matching markup should reuse DOM and hydrate normally - text and attribute mismatches degrade to warnings plus client-o