('8867be0efc2c39c7c6eb93027249adc996141698', 'docs\INTEROP.md', 'Interop Guidance', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- read once, then decode into a Go struct instead of calling `Get(...)` repeatedly from app code - prefer `storage.GetMany(...)` and `document.ElementsByID(...)` when one feature needs a grouped read instead of many scattered single-key or single-node lookups - prefer one subscription with typed fan-out in Go over many duplicated listeners on the same target - cancel observers and listeners as soon as their owner unmounts - avoid polling for layout when `ObserveResize(...)` or `ObserveIntersection(...)` is enough - reuse one imported `Module` handle while a feature is active instead of repeatedly importing the same module - batch application logic on the Go side after the browser callback fires; keep the callback itself narrow', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 5875, 6611, '- read once, then decode into a Go struct instead of calling `Get(...)` repeatedly from app code - prefer `storage.GetMany(...)` and `document.ElementsByID(...)` when one feature needs a grouped read instead of many scattered single-key or single-node lookups - prefer one subscription with typed fan-out in Go over many duplicated listeners on the same target - cancel observers and listeners as soon as their owner unmounts - avoid polling for layout when `ObserveResize(...)` or `ObserveIntersection(...)` is enough - reuse one imported `Module` handle while a feature is active instead of repeatedly importing the same module - batch application logic on the Go side after the browser callback fires; keep the callback itself narrow', '- read once, then decode into a Go struct instead of calling `Get(...)` repeatedly from app code - prefer `storage.GetMany(...)` and `document.ElementsByID(...)` when one feature needs a grouped read instead of many scattered single-key or single-node lookups - prefer one subscription with typed fan-out in Go over many duplicated listeners on the same target - canc