('a9dea5756c2488fd858c418213d97c98fa386bd3', 'docs\OFFLINE_MUTATIONS.md', 'Offline Mutation Queueing', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', 'Use it when a browser app needs to queue writes locally, survive reloads, and replay those writes later without hand-rolling storage, deduplication, and retry timing.', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 124, 290, 'Use it when a browser app needs to queue writes locally, survive reloads, and replay those writes later without hand-rolling storage, deduplication, and retry timing.', 'Use it when a browser app needs to queue writes locally, survive reloads, and replay those writes later without hand-rolling storage, deduplication, and retry timing.', 0.9, 'pass', '', 124, 290, 'Use it when a browser app needs to queue writes locally, survive reloads, and replay those writes later without hand-rolling storage, deduplication, and retry timing.', 'Use it when a browser app needs to queue writes locally, survive reloads, and replay those writes later without hand-rolling storage, deduplication, and retry timing.', 0, 0, 'manual-offline_mutations-20260330T214856467Z', 'c7817aff6f4da72f02f54dab66395ab84aa7648e7a06480eafc7c9acb32b20bf', '8c225678e2cda824a6a421a56977c69489984a1e8f1009a3fbff22b2d1b6b0dd', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
('bbc4cb538eac3daa84735bcc8c2ffde5eefbfe84', 'docs\OFFLINE_MUTATIONS.md', 'Offline Mutation Queueing', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- the queue surface is already shipped and durable today - queue persistence is IndexedDB-first with `localStorage` fallback - replay remains application-owned so auth headers, merge policy, and real HTTP execution stay under app control - queue state is visible through replay reports, structured framework logs, and PWA diagnostics snapshots', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 308, 651, '- the queue surface is already shipped and durable today - queue persistence is IndexedDB-first with `localStorage` fallback - replay remains application-owned so auth headers, merge policy, and real HTTP execution stay under app control - queue state is visible through replay reports, structured framework logs, and PWA diagnostics snapshots', '- the queue surface is already shipped and durable today - queue persistence is IndexedDB-first with `localStorage` fallback - replay remains application-owned so auth headers, merge policy, and real HTTP execution stay under app control - queue state is visible through replay reports, structured framework logs, and PWA diagnostics snapshots', 0.9, 'pass', '', 308, 651, '- the queue surface is already shipped and durable today - queue persistence is IndexedDB-first with `localStorage` fallback - replay remains application-owned so auth headers, merge policy, and real HTTP execution stay under app control - queue state is visible through replay reports, structured framework logs, and PWA diagnostics snapshots', '- the queue surface is already shipped and durable today - queue persistence is IndexedDB-first with `localStorage` fallback - replay remains application-owned so auth headers, merge policy, and real HTTP execution stay under app control - queue state is visible through replay reports, structured framework logs, and PWA diagnostics snapshots', 0, 0, 'manual-offline_mutations-20260330T214856467Z', 'c7817aff6f4da7