('413261cf6baacc48cea0e0ac1dffa4cb7d3ec8d7', 'docs\OFFLINE_MUTATIONS.md', 'Offline Mutation Queueing', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- `DedupKey` suppresses enqueuing a second non-dead entry for the same logical write - the first failure moves the entry to `retrying` - retry delay grows exponentially from `BaseDelay` up to `MaxDelay` - entries whose `NextAttemptAt` is still in the future are deferred, not executed - terminal failures become `dead` and stay persisted for user-visible remediation - if `ctx` is canceled during replay, already-processed items stay committed and untouched remaining items stay queued', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 7970, 8455, '- `DedupKey` suppresses enqueuing a second non-dead entry for the same logical write - the first failure moves the entry to `retrying` - retry delay grows exponentially from `BaseDelay` up to `MaxDelay` - entries whose `NextAttemptAt` is still in the future are deferred, not executed - terminal failures become `dead` and stay persisted for user-visible remediation - if `ctx` is canceled during replay, already-processed items stay committed and untouched remaining items stay queued', '- `DedupKey` suppresses enqueuing a second non-dead entry for the same logical write - the first failure moves the entry to `retrying` - retry delay grows exponentially from `BaseDelay` up to `MaxDelay` - entries whose `NextAttemptAt` is still in the future are deferred, not executed - terminal failures become `dead` and stay persisted for user-visible remediation - if `ctx` is canceled during replay, already-processed items stay committed and untouched remaining items stay queued', 0.9, 'pass', '', 7970, 8455, '- `DedupKey` suppresses enqueuing a second non-dead entry for the same logical write - the first failure moves the entry to `retrying` - retry delay grows exponentially from `BaseDelay` up to `MaxDelay` - entries whose `NextAttemptAt` is still in the future are deferred, not executed - terminal failures become `dead` and stay pers