('4d90e895454342eb3c39c61f53ac85dbbcb6a6ac', 'docs\ONBOARDING.md', 'Onboarding and Bootstrap', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- the repo-standard entrypoint is now `go run ./tools/gwc ...` - one-command bootstrap is available through `go run ./tools/gwc bootstrap` - the root README contains the smallest current starter-shaped app example - `gwc start` now ships starter variants for client-only, routed/dashboard, SSR, and reference-app adoption modes - larger adoption paths should choose client-rendered, routed, SSR, forms-heavy, or prerender-first architecture intentionally instead of cloning random examples', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 320, 809, '- the repo-standard entrypoint is now `go run ./tools/gwc ...` - one-command bootstrap is available through `go run ./tools/gwc bootstrap` - the root README contains the smallest current starter-shaped app example - `gwc start` now ships starter variants for client-only, routed/dashboard, SSR, and reference-app adoption modes - larger adoption paths should choose client-rendered, routed, SSR, forms-heavy, or prerender-first architecture intentionally instead of cloning random examples', '- the repo-standard entrypoint is now `go run ./tools/gwc ...` - one-command bootstrap is available through `go run ./tools/gwc bootstrap` - the root README contains the smallest current starter-shaped app example - `gwc start` now ships starter variants for client-only, routed/dashboard, SSR, and reference-app adoption modes - larger adoption paths should choose client-rendered, routed, SSR, forms-heavy, or prerender-first architecture intentionally instead of cloning random examples', 0.9, 'pass', '', 320, 809, '- the repo-standard entrypoint is now `go run ./tools/gwc ...` - one-command bootstrap is available through `go run ./tools/gwc bootstrap` - the root README contains the smallest current starter-shaped app example - `gwc start` now ships starter variants for client-only, routed/dashboard, SSR, and reference-app adoption modes - la