('c189e1d73be79ad3c159405121da44a4368a85a9', 'docs\ONBOARDING.md', 'Onboarding and Bootstrap', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '1. run `go run ./tools/gwc bootstrap` for the starter bootstrap flow (doctor checks plus scaffold start path) 2. run `go run ./tools/gwc bootstrap -examples` when you want to bootstrap from the examples catalog instead of generating a starter 3. inspect the generated `FEATURE_MATRIX.md` and `README.md` in the starter output to confirm the selected adoption mode 4. move onto `gwc build`, `gwc test`, and `gwc verify` once the app shape stabilizes', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 894, 1342, '1. run `go run ./tools/gwc bootstrap` for the starter bootstrap flow (doctor checks plus scaffold start path) 2. run `go run ./tools/gwc bootstrap -examples` when you want to bootstrap from the examples catalog instead of generating a starter 3. inspect the generated `FEATURE_MATRIX.md` and `README.md` in the starter output to confirm the selected adoption mode 4. move onto `gwc build`, `gwc test`, and `gwc verify` once the app shape stabilizes', '1. run `go run ./tools/gwc bootstrap` for the starter bootstrap flow (doctor checks plus scaffold start path) 2. run `go run ./tools/gwc bootstrap -examples` when you want to bootstrap from the examples catalog instead of generating a starter 3. inspect the generated `FEATURE_MATRIX.md` and `README.md` in the starter output to confirm the selected adoption mode 4. move onto `gwc build`, `gwc test`, and `gwc verify` once the app shape stabilizes', 0.9, 'pass', '', 894, 1342, '1. run `go run ./tools/gwc bootstrap` for the starter bootstrap flow (doctor checks plus scaffold start path) 2. run `go run ./tools/gwc bootstrap -examples` when you want to bootstrap from the examples catalog instead of generating a starter 3. inspect the generated `FEATURE_MATRIX.md` and `README.md` in the starter output to confirm the selected adoption mode 4. move onto `gwc build`, `gwc test`, and `gwc verify` once the app shape stabilizes', '1