('2be222aa14d7b73ab41e6ec382fcb43b9720f185', 'docs\PWA.md', 'PWA and Offline App Support', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', 'The helper reports installability state, manifest validation results, prompt availability, installed status, and user-visible reasons the browser has not exposed installation yet. It does not force installation UI or guess hidden browser heuristics beyond the events and secure-context signals the platform actually exposes.', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 6250, 6574, 'The helper reports installability state, manifest validation results, prompt availability, installed status, and user-visible reasons the browser has not exposed installation yet. It does not force installation UI or guess hidden browser heuristics beyond the events and secure-context signals the platform actually exposes.', 'The helper reports installability state, manifest validation results, prompt availability, installed status, and user-visible reasons the browser has not exposed installation yet. It does not force installation UI or guess hidden browser heuristics beyond the events and secure-context signals the platform actually exposes.', 0.9, 'pass', '', 6250, 6574, 'The helper reports installability state, manifest validation results, prompt availability, installed status, and user-visible reasons the browser has not exposed installation yet. It does not force installation UI or guess hidden browser heuristics beyond the events and secure-context signals the platform actually exposes.', 'The helper reports installability state, manifest validation results, prompt availability, installed status, and user-visible reasons the browser has not exposed installation yet. It does not force installation UI or guess hidden browser heuristics beyond the events and secure-context signals the platform actually exposes.', 0, 0, 'manual-pwa-20260330T214856535Z', 'ccc970ee7d17b69d151e188b2a8639fed48782e05b623f5c4789510f217dd3f1', '6de0b2ab3233a2537b0c5a72d5a9be28f82fdc79255b4ab57611ba09baa9941