('e27cb6be913006619af7fea3ecfa52257087e524', 'docs\PWA.md', 'PWA and Offline App Support', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- shell HTML and offline fallback documents: `network-first` or `stale-while-revalidate`, depending on how aggressively the application wants repeat-visit freshness - hashed wasm, JS helpers, CSS, and fingerprinted media: `cache-first` - non-hashed or correctness-sensitive route data: not part of this helper surface; keep those under app-owned fetch or service-worker logic instead of pretending Cache Storage alone solves data freshness', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 9277, 9716, '- shell HTML and offline fallback documents: `network-first` or `stale-while-revalidate`, depending on how aggressively the application wants repeat-visit freshness - hashed wasm, JS helpers, CSS, and fingerprinted media: `cache-first` - non-hashed or correctness-sensitive route data: not part of this helper surface; keep those under app-owned fetch or service-worker logic instead of pretending Cache Storage alone solves data freshness', '- shell HTML and offline fallback documents: `network-first` or `stale-while-revalidate`, depending on how aggressively the application wants repeat-visit freshness - hashed wasm, JS helpers, CSS, and fingerprinted media: `cache-first` - non-hashed or correctness-sensitive route data: not part of this helper surface; keep those under app-owned fetch or service-worker logic instead of pretending Cache Storage alone solves data freshness', 0.9, 'pass', '', 9277, 9716, '- shell HTML and offline fallback documents: `network-first` or `stale-while-revalidate`, depending on how aggressively the application wants repeat-visit freshness - hashed wasm, JS helpers, CSS, and fingerprinted media: `cache-first` - non-hashed or correctness-sensitive route data: not part of this helper surface; keep those under app-owned fetch or service-worker logic instead of pretending Cache Storage alone solves data freshness', '- shell HTML and offline fallback documents: `network-first` or `stale-while-revalidate`, depending on how aggressively the application wants repeat-visit freshness - hashed wasm, JS helpers, CSS, and fingerprinted media: `cache-first` - non-hashed or correctness-sensitive route data: not part of this helper surface; keep those under app-owned fetch or service-worker logic instead of pretending Cache Storage alone solves data freshness', 0, 0, 'manual-pwa-20260330T214856535Z', 'ccc970ee7d17b69d151e188b2a8639fed48782e05b623f5c4789510f217dd3f1', 'f3aabc2eefaed1c86c286e68581377e752a798f6770d3b6036fd8e207959a53d', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
