('55bfe3f1da5130f885fb52f8b5f4606d3f6ff575', 'docs\PWA.md', 'PWA and Offline App Support', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', 'Applications may surface this snapshot through their own diagnostics drawer, devtools panel, or support bundle flow. The framework keeps the data structured and typed; applications decide how aggressively to poll it and where to render it.', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 10959, 11198, 'Applications may surface this snapshot through their own diagnostics drawer, devtools panel, or support bundle flow. The framework keeps the data structured and typed; applications decide how aggressively to poll it and where to render it.', 'Applications may surface this snapshot through their own diagnostics drawer, devtools panel, or support bundle flow. The framework keeps the data structured and typed; applications decide how aggressively to poll it and where to render it.', 0.9, 'pass', '', 10959, 11198, 'Applications may surface this snapshot through their own diagnostics drawer, devtools panel, or support bundle flow. The framework keeps the data structured and typed; applications decide how aggressively to poll it and where to render it.', 'Applications may surface this snapshot through their own diagnostics drawer, devtools panel, or support bundle flow. The framework keeps the data structured and typed; applications decide how aggressively to poll it and where to render it.', 0, 0, 'manual-pwa-20260330T214856535Z', 'ccc970ee7d17b69d151e188b2a8639fed48782e05b623f5c4789510f217dd3f1', '70404219dd211fb889e4f701aac35ebf187a8b9f7422e69066de67ed382963e6', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
