('c2a278eca4cf12a9f3136ba6feafbe6581f59076', 'docs\PWA.md', 'PWA and Offline App Support', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- keep the queue transport and the UI workflow separate; the queue stores intent, but the app chooses how and where to render repair actions - link UI actions back to explicit queue outcomes such as discard, requeue with merge, retry, or open a record-level editor - show conflict reasons in domain language when possible, while preserving the structured technical cause for diagnostics and support - prefer narrow per-record repair over one giant modal whenever only a few entities are conflicted', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 26222, 26719, '- keep the queue transport and the UI workflow separate; the queue stores intent, but the app chooses how and where to render repair actions - link UI actions back to explicit queue outcomes such as discard, requeue with merge, retry, or open a record-level editor - show conflict reasons in domain language when possible, while preserving the structured technical cause for diagnostics and support - prefer narrow per-record repair over one giant modal whenever only a few entities are conflicted', '- keep the queue transport and the UI workflow separate; the queue stores intent, but the app chooses how and where to render repair actions - link UI actions back to explicit queue outcomes such as discard, requeue with merge, retry, or open a record-level editor - show conflict reasons in domain language when possible, while preserving the structured technical cause for diagnostics and support - prefer narrow per-record repair over one giant modal whenever only a few entities are conflicted', 0.9, 'pass', '', 26222, 26719, '- keep the queue transport and the UI workflow separate; the queue stores intent, but the app chooses how and where to render repair actions - link UI actions back to explicit queue outcomes such as discard, requeue with merge, retry, or open a record-level editor - show conflict reasons in domain langu