('fd986a9a91231fcd4ce508c930ceb6382c7ce723', 'docs\ROUTER_AUTH.md', 'Router Async Guards And Auth Design', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- `Redirect`: navigate to another internal target instead of completing the requested route - `Blocked`: stop the navigation and keep the current route - `Reason`: optional explanation for diagnostics or app-owned UI - `Denied`: mark the decision as an authorization-style denial instead of a generic block - `Retryable`: identify a transient failure so application UI can offer retry behavior', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 4414, 4807, '- `Redirect`: navigate to another internal target instead of completing the requested route - `Blocked`: stop the navigation and keep the current route - `Reason`: optional explanation for diagnostics or app-owned UI - `Denied`: mark the decision as an authorization-style denial instead of a generic block - `Retryable`: identify a transient failure so application UI can offer retry behavior', '- `Redirect`: navigate to another internal target instead of completing the requested route - `Blocked`: stop the navigation and keep the current route - `Reason`: optional explanation for diagnostics or app-owned UI - `Denied`: mark the decision as an authorization-style denial instead of a generic block - `Retryable`: identify a transient failure so application UI can offer retry behavior', 0.9, 'pass', '', 4414, 4807, '- `Redirect`: navigate to another internal target instead of completing the requested route - `Blocked`: stop the navigation and keep the current route - `Reason`: optional explanation for diagnostics or app-owned UI - `Denied`: mark the decision as an authorization-style denial instead of a generic block - `Retryable`: identify a transient failure so application UI can offer retry behavior', '- `Redirect`: navigate to another internal target instead of completing the requested route - `Blocked`: stop the navigation and keep the current route - `Reason`: optional explanation for diagnostics or app