('39d451dd1011c3b8f3161857714f4f080fe5ebae', 'docs\RPC_TRANSPORT.md', 'Typed RPC and Streaming Transport', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', 'The framework should not claim a sophisticated adaptive flow-control algorithm in the first version. The important first guarantee is bounded memory plus clear typed failure when producers outrun consumers.', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 18162, 18368, 'The framework should not claim a sophisticated adaptive flow-control algorithm in the first version. The important first guarantee is bounded memory plus clear typed failure when producers outrun consumers.', 'The framework should not claim a sophisticated adaptive flow-control algorithm in the first version. The important first guarantee is bounded memory plus clear typed failure when producers outrun consumers.', 0.9, 'pass', '', 18162, 18368, 'The framework should not claim a sophisticated adaptive flow-control algorithm in the first version. The important first guarantee is bounded memory plus clear typed failure when producers outrun consumers.', 'The framework should not claim a sophisticated adaptive flow-control algorithm in the first version. The important first guarantee is bounded memory plus clear typed failure when producers outrun consumers.', 0, 0, 'manual-rpc_transport-20260330T214856580Z', 'b64ddfb9b1d91f2cb743b98c390738ad442c4a48c9b799b1b62e5c217b79108b', '02cc98139749a779c4315313bf08d10cb16e9fbac88620e8816583c9bb002056', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
