('7fc7493dcc1ca5b707d361ea52aa4a28a94ef312', 'docs\RUNNER_CONFIG.md', 'Runner Config Schema', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', 'Use [gwc-runner.example.json](examples/gwc-runner.example.json) as the canonical example. Relative paths are resolved from the directory that contains the config file, whether the file is discovered as `gwc-runner.json`, pointed to by `GWC_RUNNER_CONFIG`, or loaded from the home-level fallback at `.gwc/runner.json`.', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 300, 617, 'Use [gwc-runner.example.json](examples/gwc-runner.example.json) as the canonical example. Relative paths are resolved from the directory that contains the config file, whether the file is discovered as `gwc-runner.json`, pointed to by `GWC_RUNNER_CONFIG`, or loaded from the home-level fallback at `.gwc/runner.json`.', 'Use [gwc-runner.example.json](examples/gwc-runner.example.json) as the canonical example. Relative paths are resolved from the directory that contains the config file, whether the file is discovered as `gwc-runner.json`, pointed to by `GWC_RUNNER_CONFIG`, or loaded from the home-level fallback at `.gwc/runner.json`.', 0.9, 'pass', '', 300, 617, 'Use [gwc-runner.example.json](examples/gwc-runner.example.json) as the canonical example. Relative paths are resolved from the directory that contains the config file, whether the file is discovered as `gwc-runner.json`, pointed to by `GWC_RUNNER_CONFIG`, or loaded from the home-level fallback at `.gwc/runner.json`.', 'Use [gwc-runner.example.json](examples/gwc-runner.example.json) as the canonical example. Relative paths are resolved from the directory that contains the config file, whether the file is discovered as `gwc-runner.json`, pointed to by `GWC_RUNNER_CONFIG`, or loaded from the home-level fallback at `.gwc/runner.json`.', 0, 0, 'manual-runner_config-20260330T214856602Z', '867366aadb058e77b48231ff0b37fed545303f90d8e503b1492ca16113fad28d', 'a47600789897e765a932a2dd446ebd773294888316df58000d0b167173bf3916', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none'