('abab934f1f2b8d5e420846002b0f85b72afe7d56', 'docs\TEAM_CONVENTIONS.md', 'Team-Scale Conventions', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- hooks: prefer small workflow hooks that wrap `ui.UseState` or `ui.UseReducer` for feature logic - shared state: use `state` atoms/selectors for cross-route state; avoid ad hoc globals - loaders and async resources: keep route-critical fetches in loaders, component-local fetches in feature hooks - forms: standardize on one validation and submit outcome projection pattern per app', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 1355, 1737, '- hooks: prefer small workflow hooks that wrap `ui.UseState` or `ui.UseReducer` for feature logic - shared state: use `state` atoms/selectors for cross-route state; avoid ad hoc globals - loaders and async resources: keep route-critical fetches in loaders, component-local fetches in feature hooks - forms: standardize on one validation and submit outcome projection pattern per app', '- hooks: prefer small workflow hooks that wrap `ui.UseState` or `ui.UseReducer` for feature logic - shared state: use `state` atoms/selectors for cross-route state; avoid ad hoc globals - loaders and async resources: keep route-critical fetches in loaders, component-local fetches in feature hooks - forms: standardize on one validation and submit outcome projection pattern per app', 0.9, 'pass', '', 1355, 1737, '- hooks: prefer small workflow hooks that wrap `ui.UseState` or `ui.UseReducer` for feature logic - shared state: use `state` atoms/selectors for cross-route state; avoid ad hoc globals - loaders and async resources: keep route-critical fetches in loaders, component-local fetches in feature hooks - forms: standardize on one validation and submit outcome projection pattern per app', '- hooks: prefer small workflow hooks that wrap `ui.UseState` or `ui.UseReducer` for feature logic - shared state: use `state` atoms/selectors for cross-route state; avoid ad hoc globals - loaders and async resources: keep route-critical fetches in loaders, co