('035639c02a2683ac9357bb0b607d72aa7c653c62', 'docs\VIRTUALIZATION.md', 'Virtualization', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- passing viewport-math regressions for the owned-scroll list contract - passing restoration and hydration regressions for the shipped example surfaces - browser benchmark coverage that compares the virtualized feed against a full-render baseline - stable diagnostics budgets where measurement, invalidation, and scroll-correction churn remain zero for the fixed-height primitive', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 21652, 22031, '- passing viewport-math regressions for the owned-scroll list contract - passing restoration and hydration regressions for the shipped example surfaces - browser benchmark coverage that compares the virtualized feed against a full-render baseline - stable diagnostics budgets where measurement, invalidation, and scroll-correction churn remain zero for the fixed-height primitive', '- passing viewport-math regressions for the owned-scroll list contract - passing restoration and hydration regressions for the shipped example surfaces - browser benchmark coverage that compares the virtualized feed against a full-render baseline - stable diagnostics budgets where measurement, invalidation, and scroll-correction churn remain zero for the fixed-height primitive', 0.9, 'pass', '', 21652, 22031, '- passing viewport-math regressions for the owned-scroll list contract - passing restoration and hydration regressions for the shipped example surfaces - browser benchmark coverage that compares the virtualized feed against a full-render baseline - stable diagnostics budgets where measurement, invalidation, and scroll-correction churn remain zero for the fixed-height primitive', '- passing viewport-math regressions for the owned-scroll list contract - passing restoration and hydration regressions for the shipped example surfaces - browser benchmark coverage that compares the virtualized feed against a full-render baseline - stable diagnostics budgets where measurement, invalidation, and scroll-correction churn remain zero for the fixed-height primitive', 0, 0, 'manual-virtualization-20260330T214856740Z', '5f7e9d93d6c4511721bc4e09a490fa664462e57bf035dda4d28347eabaf6aa2b', '534f3d8b149815f01483839e68a78a96d4ff1f99073551aadc0c987a9df1a0ae', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
('f56c56da2de59fa90ee3a5f60feca7916d611087', 'docs\VIRTUALIZATION.md', 'Virtualization', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', 'If those fixed-height proofs stop holding, the project should treat that as a regression in the first primitive rather than expanding into measured-row support early.', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 22033, 22199, 'If those fixed-height proofs stop holding, the project should treat that as a regression in the first primitive rather than expanding into measured-row support early.', 'If those fixed-height proofs stop holding, the project should treat that as a regression in the first primitive rather than expanding into measured-row support early.', 0.9, 'pass', '', 22033, 22199, 'If those fixed-height proofs stop holding, the project should treat that as a regression in the first primitive rather than expanding into measured-row support early.', 'If those fixed-height proofs stop holding, the project should treat that as a regression in the first primitive rather than expanding into measured-row support early.', 0, 0, 'manual-virtualization-20260330T214856740Z', '5f7e9d93d6c4511721bc4e09a490fa664462e57bf035dda4d28347eabaf6aa2b', '214f5c333aaeab19efc27f9902b466a9e8bcf956509f4f9259249f1451c2c35c', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
('e95ebaca0be61f7ca8fe7702cfe9123c8229b623', 'docs\VIRTUALIZATION.md', 'Virtualization', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- if the problem is basic rendering or hooks composition, it belongs in core `ui` - if the problem is full windowed-list ownership with measurement, overscan, scrolling, and restoration policy, it should start in the supported virtualization companion layer', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 22234, 22491, '- if the problem is basic rendering or hooks composition, it belongs in core `ui` - if the problem is full windowed-list ownership with measurement, overscan, scrolling, and restoration policy, it should start in the supported virtualization companion layer', '- if the problem is basic rendering or hooks composition, it belongs in core `ui` - if the problem is full windowed-list ownership with measurement, overscan, scrolling, and restoration policy, it should start in the supported virtualization companion layer', 0.9, 'pass', '', 22234, 22491, '- if the problem is basic rendering or hooks composition, it belongs in core `ui` - if the problem is full windowed-list ownership with measurement, overscan, scrolling, and restoration policy, it should start in the supported virtualization companion layer', '- if the problem is basic rendering or hooks composition, it belongs in core `ui` - if the problem is full windowed-list ownership with measurement, overscan, scrolling, and restoration policy, it should start in the supported virtualization companion layer', 0, 0, 'manual-virtualization-20260330T214856740Z', '5f7e9d93d6c4511721bc4e09a490fa664462e57bf035dda4d28347eabaf6aa2b', 'e8bf0cdb963b834c10c6f6648fedb15076863304c584af1c3c3f0013ec64c076', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now'));

