('00e9542791545ad4f29d7105e4a00dee10a3cd13', 'docs\WASM_RELEASES.md', 'Wasm Build Profiles and Release Engineering', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- pin the Go toolchain version in CI and release automation - use one documented release command path instead of per-developer flag variations - prefer `-trimpath` and `-buildvcs=false` for reproducible release artifacts unless a deliberate provenance requirement says otherwise - record the emitted artifact hashes and sizes in `wasm-release-manifest.json` - treat release manifests, hashes, and build flags as part of the release record, not as incidental console output', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 6243, 6715, '- pin the Go toolchain version in CI and release automation - use one documented release command path instead of per-developer flag variations - prefer `-trimpath` and `-buildvcs=false` for reproducible release artifacts unless a deliberate provenance requirement says otherwise - record the emitted artifact hashes and sizes in `wasm-release-manifest.json` - treat release manifests, hashes, and build flags as part of the release record, not as incidental console output', '- pin the Go toolchain version in CI and release automation - use one documented release command path instead of per-developer flag variations - prefer `-trimpath` and `-buildvcs=false` for reproducible release artifacts unless a deliberate provenance requirement says otherwise - record the emitted artifact hashes and sizes in `wasm-release-manifest.json` - treat release manifests, hashes, and build flags as part of the release record, not as incidental console output', 0.9, 'pass', '', 6243, 6715, '- pin the Go toolchain version in CI and release automation - use one documented release command path instead of per-developer flag variations - prefer `-trimpath` and `-buildvcs=false` for reproducible release artifacts unless a deliberate provenance requirement says otherwise - record the emitted artifact hashes and sizes in `wasm-release-manifest.json`