('5741e2f6caf1a52a7fc4860e1fd80407f44a5a85', 'docs\WORKER_POOLS_VS_LANES.md', 'Worker Pools Vs Lanes', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '1. Open workers directly with `interop.OpenGoWASMWorker(...)` and store `[]interop.Worker`. 2. Replace `pool.Request(...)` callers with direct `RequestWorkerDecoded(...)` against the mapped worker handle. 3. Preserve cancellation and timeout behavior from the old path. 4. Add explicit close handling (`worker.Terminate()`) for app unmount or mode switch. 5. Re-run scenario tests and perf checks, then compare before/after benchmark outputs.', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 2644, 3086, '1. Open workers directly with `interop.OpenGoWASMWorker(...)` and store `[]interop.Worker`. 2. Replace `pool.Request(...)` callers with direct `RequestWorkerDecoded(...)` against the mapped worker handle. 3. Preserve cancellation and timeout behavior from the old path. 4. Add explicit close handling (`worker.Terminate()`) for app unmount or mode switch. 5. Re-run scenario tests and perf checks, then compare before/after benchmark outputs.', '1. Open workers directly with `interop.OpenGoWASMWorker(...)` and store `[]interop.Worker`. 2. Replace `pool.Request(...)` callers with direct `RequestWorkerDecoded(...)` against the mapped worker handle. 3. Preserve cancellation and timeout behavior from the old path. 4. Add explicit close handling (`worker.Terminate()`) for app unmount or mode switch. 5. Re-run scenario tests and perf checks, then compare before/after benchmark outputs.', 0.9, 'pass', '', 2644, 3086, '1. Open workers directly with `interop.OpenGoWASMWorker(...)` and store `[]interop.Worker`. 2. Replace `pool.Request(...)` callers with direct `RequestWorkerDecoded(...)` against the mapped worker handle. 3. Preserve cancellation and timeout behavior from the old path. 4. Add explicit close handling (`worker.Terminate()`) for app unmount or mode switch. 5. Re-run scenario tests and perf checks, then compare before/after benchmark outputs.', '1. Open workers directly with `interop.OpenGoWASMWorker(...)` and store `[]interop.Worker`. 2. Replace `pool.Request(...)` callers with direct `RequestWorkerDecoded(...)` against the mapped worker handle. 3. Preserve cancellation and timeout behavior from the old path. 4. Add explicit close handling (`worker.Terminate()`) for app unmount or mode switch. 5. Re-run scenario tests and perf checks, then compare before/after benchmark outputs.', 0, 0, 'manual-worker_pools_vs_lanes-20260330T214856771Z', '86f895a3c1af2f5e91d312519f4f05431e8e56bccdb37a66fe8eabb36eb039e3', '061c103bfc1572e362d06cf7a2b13f5a3563ce8ffeae5abb2fe1bbca784ce5a3', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now')),
('15cfbc85f79d88501a461f1683e5a81a7cc74347', 'docs\WORKER_POOLS_VS_LANES.md', 'Worker Pools Vs Lanes', NULL, 'paragraph', 'Paragraph', '- `examples/200-runtime2-status`: direct worker lanes for one-probe-per-worker fanout. - `examples/201-render-benchmark`: direct worker lanes for deterministic chunk preparation. - `interop/worker_fanout_bench_test.go`: focused dispatch overhead comparison harness.', '{"type":"paragraph"}', 3111, 3376, '- `examples/200-runtime2-status`: direct worker lanes for one-probe-per-worker fanout. - `examples/201-render-benchmark`: direct worker lanes for deterministic chunk preparation. - `interop/worker_fanout_bench_test.go`: focused dispatch overhead comparison harness.', '- `examples/200-runtime2-status`: direct worker lanes for one-probe-per-worker fanout. - `examples/201-render-benchmark`: direct worker lanes for deterministic chunk preparation. - `interop/worker_fanout_bench_test.go`: focused dispatch overhead comparison harness.', 0.9, 'pass', '', 3111, 3376, '- `examples/200-runtime2-status`: direct worker lanes for one-probe-per-worker fanout. - `examples/201-render-benchmark`: direct worker lanes for deterministic chunk preparation. - `interop/worker_fanout_bench_test.go`: focused dispatch overhead comparison harness.', '- `examples/200-runtime2-status`: direct worker lanes for one-probe-per-worker fanout. - `examples/201-render-benchmark`: direct worker lanes for deterministic chunk preparation. - `interop/worker_fanout_bench_test.go`: focused dispatch overhead comparison harness.', 0, 0, 'manual-worker_pools_vs_lanes-20260330T214856771Z', '86f895a3c1af2f5e91d312519f4f05431e8e56bccdb37a66fe8eabb36eb039e3', '17c6c8e8c18cf219ec08c021f6b94ff2a1767471e75805fdf65e7686adcc31f2', 1, 'manual-v1', 'none', datetime('now'));

